insert into public.spike_i18n_packs(language_code,display_name,translations,version) values ('ha', 'ha', '{"# Channels":"# tashoshi","(optional)":"(zaɓi ne)","+ Achievement":"+ nasara","+ Challenge":"+ ƙalubale","+ Mission":"+ manufa","+ Package":"+ kunshi","+ Room":"+ Ɗaki","+8% this week":"+8% wannan week","0 XP":"0 XP","0 items":"0 abubuwa","0 online":"0 kan layi","0 unlocked":"0 an buɗe","1 year":"1 shekara","1 year 6 months":"1 shekara 6 months","1,000 XP":"1,000 XP","1. A room member repeatedly posts spam. What should a creator do first?":"1. Wani ɗaki mamba repeatedly wallafe-wallafe spam. Menene should wani mahalicci do first?","1. Complete your identity":"1. Complete naka ainihi","1. Create the mission":"1. Ƙirƙira na mission","1. Policy principles":"1. Manufa principles","10. Copyright and intellectual property":"10. Copyright da intellectual property","100 XP":"100 XP","100 XP to Level 2":"100 XP zuwa Mataki 2","11. Transparency and accountability":"11. Transparency da accountability","12 lessons":"12 lessons","12. Policy changes":"12. Manufa canje-canje","14 lessons":"14 lessons","15m":"15m","16 lessons":"16 lessons","1X2":"1X2","1h":"1h","1× XP":"1× XP","2 lessons + a short check":"2 lessons + wani short duba","2. Publish useful content":"2. Publish mai amfani abun ciki","2. Safety":"2. Tsaro","2. What is the best room rule?":"2. Menene ne na best ɗaki rule?","2. XP is also difficulty":"2. XP ne also difficulty","24 hours":"24 hours","24h":"24h","250 XP":"250 XP","3 this week":"3 wannan week","3 topics need attention":"3 topics buƙata attention","3. A creator should give moderators power based mainly on:":"3. Wani mahalicci should give moderators power based mainly akan:","3. Build real relationships":"3. Build real relationships","3. Join and contribute":"3. Shiga da contribute","3. Prohibited content":"3. Haramun abun ciki","30 days":"30 kwanaki","31 sections":"31 sections","4. Community conduct":"4. Al’umma conduct","4. Completion and reward":"4. Completion da reward","4. Participate in Rooms":"4. Shiga a Ɗakuna","4. What should happen when a serious safety issue is reported?":"4. Menene should happen lokacin wani serious tsaro issue ne reported?","48 hours":"48 hours","5 questions · 5 min":"5 questions · 5 min","5. Maintain your streak":"5. Maintain naka jerin nasara","5. Privacy":"5. Sirri","5. The strongest community is built by:":"5. Na strongest al’umma ne built by:","50 XP":"50 XP","500 XP":"500 XP","6-digit verification code":"6-digit verification lamba","6. Platform abuse":"6. Platform abuse","6. Protect quality":"6. Protect quality","7 days":"7 kwanaki","7. Enforcement":"7. Enforcement","7. Use discovery intelligently":"7. Yi amfani ganowa intelligently","72 hours":"72 hours","8 chapters · 31 sections · worked examples · review.":"8 chapters · 31 sections · worked examples · bita.","8. Appeals":"8. Appeals","8. Use premium tools responsibly":"8. Yi amfani premium tools responsibly","9. Recommendation safety":"9. Recommendation tsaro","9Y":"9Y","@spike":"@spike","A Room Account gives you a Room-specific handle, display name and optional bio. New Room Accounts start at Novice and can earn Room XP through Room activity.":"Wani Ɗaki Asusun gives kai wani Ɗaki-specific handle, display suna da zaɓi ne bio. Sabo Ɗaki Accounts fara at Novice da iya earn Ɗaki XP ta hanyar Ɗaki aiki.","A community space for people who want an ongoing place to connect, talk and participate together.":"Wani al’umma space don mutane waye so wani ongoing place zuwa haɗa, talk da shiga together.","A compact view of how you''re participating across SPIKE.":"Wani compact duba na yaya kai''re participating across SPIKE.","A connected sequence of ideas where each entry builds on the previous contribution.":"Wani connected sequence na ideas ina each entry builds akan na previous contribution.","A detection signal is not automatically proof of a violation. Systems should distinguish clear violations from context-dependent cases and route uncertain cases to review when appropriate.":"Wani detection sigina ne not automatically proof na wani violation. Systems should distinguish raba violations daga context-dependent ƙararraki da route uncertain ƙararraki zuwa bita lokacin appropriate.","A friendly head-to-head challenge between two friends where eligible community members vote for the winner.":"Wani friendly head-zuwa-head challenge between two abokai ina cancanta al’umma mambobi vote don na winner.","A limited-time competition that turns eligible SPIKE World activity into Season Points and a shared leaderboard.":"Wani limited-lokaci competition cewa turns cancanta SPIKE Duniya aiki into Season Points da wani shared leaderboard.","A prediction says high confidence. Is it guaranteed?":"Wani prediction says babba amincewa. Ne it guaranteed?","A quick confirmation before you continue.":"Wani quick confirmation kafin kai ci gaba.","A shared challenge where members work toward one community goal before the deadline.":"Wani shared challenge ina mambobi work toward one al’umma goal kafin na deadline.","A short lesson, followed by three recall questions. Finish this before starting another topic.":"Wani short darasi, followed by three recall questions. Finish wannan kafin starting another topic.","A simple daily routine keeps SPIKE useful without turning it into a race to generate activity.":"Wani simple kullum routine keeps SPIKE mai amfani without turning it into wani race zuwa generate aiki.","A simple view of your current Feed and feature activity.":"Wani simple duba na naka current Ciyarwa da feature aiki.","A strong creator is consistent, clear, fair and useful. Good rules and good moderation matter more than raw message volume.":"Wani strong mahalicci ne consistent, raba, adalci da mai amfani. Good dokoki da good tsari matter ƙari than raw saƙo volume.","A unified layer for reputation, discovery, conversations, Rooms, Events, memory, creators and your personal activity. These upgrades work with the systems already inside SPIKE instead of replacing them.":"Wani unified layer don reputation, ganowa, tattaunawa, Ɗakuna, Events, memory, creators da naka personal aiki. These upgrades work da na systems already inside SPIKE instead na replacing them.","A user''s personal muted-word preference changes that user''s feed. A platform prohibited-content rule changes content eligibility for everyone. These systems must remain separate.":"Wani mai amfani''s personal muted-word preference canje-canje cewa mai amfani''s ciyarwa. Wani platform haramun-abun ciki rule canje-canje abun ciki eligibility don kowa. These systems must remain separate.","ABOUT THIS MEMBER":"Game da Wannan Mamba","AI":"AI","AI Assist":"AI Assist","Aa":"Aa","About":"Game da","About this room":"Game da wannan ɗaki","Accept":"Karɓa","Account":"Asusun","Account & identity":"Asusun & ainihi","Account access":"Asusun samun dama","Account age requirement: your SPIKE account must be at least":"Asusun age requirement: naka SPIKE asusun must be at least","Account controls":"Asusun controls","Account safety and platform policy remain governed by SPIKE''s existing privacy, moderation and appeals systems.":"Asusun tsaro da platform manufa remain governed by SPIKE''s existing sirri, tsari da appeals systems.","Account, Sessions & Loading":"Asusun, Sessions & Ana lodawa","Achievements":"nasarori","Achievements are one-time milestones for activity such as connections, creation, engagement, levels and streaks. The Hub shows whether each achievement is unlocked.":"Achievements su one-lokaci milestones don aiki such as connections, creation, engagement, levels da streaks. Na Hub shows whether each achievement ne unlocked.","Act":"Act","Active":"Aiki","Active packages":"Aiki packages","Active users (last 30 days)":"Aiki masu amfani (last 30 kwanaki)","Activity":"Aiki","Activity trend":"Aiki trend","Activity type":"Aiki type","Add a clear topic and optional context.":"Add wani raba topic da zaɓi ne context.","Add a display name, username, bio and useful profile details. Your profile is your public identity.":"Add wani display suna, username, bio da mai amfani bayanan martaba details. Naka bayanan martaba ne naka na jama’a ainihi.","Add an optional description.":"Add wani zaɓi ne bayani.","Add governed term":"Add governed term","Add governed term or phrase":"Add governed term ko jimla","Add hook":"Add hook","Add link":"Add mahada","Add media to your Signal.":"Add kafofin watsa labarai zuwa naka Sigina.","Admin":"Mai gudanarwa","Admin actions use protected Supabase functions.":"Mai gudanarwa ayyuka yi amfani protected Supabase functions.","Administration":"Administration","Administrative accountability":"Administrative accountability","Administrative moderation decisions should be permission-controlled and logged. Privileged tools should not bypass the policy record.":"Administrative tsari decisions should be permission-controlled da logged. Privileged tools should not bypass na manufa record.","Advance your rank":"Advance naka rank","After verification, SPIKE gives you a lifetime SP ID. You can copy it from your profile.":"After verification, SPIKE gives kai wani lifetime SP Shaida. Kai iya kwafi it daga naka bayanan martaba.","Alerts":"Alerts","Algebra, numbers & functions":"Algebra, numbers & functions","Algorithms & computing":"Algorithms & computing","All":"Duk","All Friends":"Duk Abokai","All Supabase Auth-registered users with their SPIKE profile, SP_ID, wallet and Rooms membership.":"Duk Supabase Auth-registered masu amfani da their SPIKE bayanan martaba, SP_Shaida, wallet da Ɗakuna membership.","All activity":"Duk aiki","All leagues":"Duk leagues","All registered Auth users":"Duk registered Auth masu amfani","All time":"Duk lokaci","Allow browser-level notifications when supported.":"Allow burauza-mataki sanarwa lokacin ana tallafawa.","Allow calls":"Allow calls","Allow eligible review.":"Allow cancanta bita.","Allow messages":"Allow saƙonni","Allow your profile to appear in discovery":"Allow naka bayanan martaba zuwa appear a ganowa","Allow your profile to appear in profile discovery.":"Allow naka bayanan martaba zuwa appear a bayanan martaba ganowa.","Almost there":"Almost there","Almost there.":"Almost there.","Already have an account?":"Already have wani asusun?","An approved appeal can restore eligible content and overturn the original decision. A rejected appeal leaves the enforcement in place. Both outcomes must be recorded in an immutable audit trail.":"Wani approved ƙara iya restore cancanta abun ciki da overturn na original decision. Wani rejected ƙara leaves na enforcement a place. Duka outcomes must be recorded a wani immutable audit trail.","Announcements":"Announcements","Anti-abuse caps JSON":"Anti-abuse caps JSON","Anti-claim architecture:":"Anti-claim architecture:","Appeal":"Ƙara","Appeal decisions":"Ƙara decisions","Appeal decisions appear here and in notifications.":"Ƙara decisions appear here da a sanarwa.","Appeal eligibility":"Ƙara eligibility","Appeal queue":"Ƙara queue","Appealed":"Appealed","Appeals":"Appeals","Appeals are a separate decision layer. An appeal should never silently edit or erase the original moderation record.":"Appeals su wani separate decision layer. Wani ƙara should never silently gyara ko erase na original tsari record.","Appearance":"Appearance","Approved":"Approved","Archived":"Archived","Arctic Platinum":"Arctic Platinum","Are you sure?":"Su kai sure?","Arts":"Arts","Ask":"Ask","Ask AI":"Ask AI","Ask SPIKE AI":"Ask SPIKE AI","Ask SPIKE anything about the app…":"Ask SPIKE anything game da na app…","Ask a question":"Ask wani question","Attacks, dehumanization or calls for harm targeting people because of protected characteristics are prohibited. Discussion, criticism, reporting or educational context can require contextual review.":"Attacks, dehumanization ko calls don harm targeting mutane because na protected characteristics su haramun. Discussion, criticism, reporting ko educational context iya require contextual bita.","Attempts to compromise SPIKE or evade its controls are prohibited.":"Attempts zuwa compromise SPIKE ko evade its controls su haramun.","Audience":"Audience","Audience: Everyone":"Audience: Kowa","Audio & Video Calls":"Audio & Video Calls","Aurora Glass":"Aurora Glass","Auto":"Auto","Automatic Achievements":"Automatic nasarori","Automatic removal should be reserved for rules with sufficiently high confidence. The moderation event should preserve the matched policy ID, policy version, decision source, timestamp and relevant evidence.":"Automatic removal should be reserved don dokoki da sufficiently babba amincewa. Na tsari event should preserve na matched manufa Shaida, manufa version, decision source, timestamp da relevant evidence.","Automatic takedown":"Automatic takedown","Avatar image":"Avatar image","Avoid spam, repetitive comments, engagement bait and artificial activity. Sustainable reputation wins.":"Avoid spam, repetitive comments, engagement bait da artificial aiki. Sustainable reputation wins.","BEST CONFIDENCE":"BEST Amincewa","BIOLOGY":"BIOLOGY","BTTS":"BTTS","Back":"Baya","Back to Rooms":"Baya zuwa Ɗakuna","Back to SPIKE":"Baya zuwa SPIKE","Back to SPIKE sign in":"Baya zuwa SPIKE sa hannu a","Badge":"Badge","Banner ends at (optional)":"Banner ends at (zaɓi ne)","Based on what you are learning now.":"Based akan menene kai su learning yanzu.","Battles":"Battles","Battles turn posts into competition. Chains turn ideas into journeys. Missions turn activity into teamwork. Seasons make progress matter. Circles give people a home.":"Battles turn wallafe-wallafe into competition. Chains turn ideas into journeys. Missions turn aiki into teamwork. Seasons make ci gaba matter. Circles give mutane wani gida.","Battles, Chains, Missions, Seasons & Circles":"Battles, Chains, manufofi, Seasons & Circles","Become a SPIKE Creator":"Become wani SPIKE Mahalicci","Become a member to participate in the conversation.":"Become wani mamba zuwa shiga a na tattaunawa.","Best experience:":"Best experience:","Best first move: make your profile useful, follow people you genuinely care about, and start participating before chasing numbers.":"Best first move: make naka bayanan martaba mai amfani, follow mutane kai genuinely care game da, da fara participating kafin chasing numbers.","Best-practice checklist":"Best-practice checklist","Best-ranked posts right now, updated as signals change.":"Best-ranked wallafe-wallafe right yanzu, updated as signals canza.","Big encouragement":"Big encouragement","Binary numbers":"Binary numbers","Bio":"Bio","Biology":"Biology","Block":"Toshe","Block/report abuse, scams or harassment and avoid sharing credentials or verification codes.":"Toshe/ba da rahoto abuse, scams ko harassment da avoid sharing credentials ko verification codes.","Blocking uses SPIKE''s existing private-message protection and can remove the ability to interact with this member.":"Blocking uses SPIKE''s existing na sirri-saƙo protection da iya cire na ability zuwa interact da wannan mamba.","Boosts and premium presentation can increase visibility where offered, but they do not replace quality or guarantee a ranking position.":"Boosts da premium presentation iya increase gani ina offered, but they do not replace quality ko guarantee wani matsayi position.","Both":"Duka","Browse Rooms to find communities that match your interests. Open a Room to learn more before joining.":"Browse Ɗakuna zuwa find al’ummomi cewa match naka interests. Buɗe wani Ɗaki zuwa learn ƙari kafin joining.","Browse a structured starting point for university study.":"Browse wani structured starting point don university study.","Browse live communities and trending Rooms.":"Browse live al’ummomi da trending Ɗakuna.","Browse the Feed":"Browse na Ciyarwa","Browse video-focused content.":"Browse video-focused abun ciki.","Browse your Feed, post an update, follow people, send a friend request, start a conversation or explore Rooms.":"Browse naka Ciyarwa, wallafa wani update, follow mutane, aika wani aboki request, fara wani tattaunawa ko explore Ɗakuna.","Browse, react, follow conversations and participate whenever you have something useful to add.":"Browse, react, follow tattaunawa da shiga whenever kai have something mai amfani zuwa add.","Browser notifications":"Burauza sanarwa","Build an idea one response at a time.":"Build wani idea one response at wani lokaci.","Build personal Feeds from topics you choose.":"Build personal Feeds daga topics kai zaɓa.","Build reputation through consistency":"Build reputation ta hanyar consistency","Build your connections and discover people.":"Build naka connections da gano mutane.","Build your progress":"Build naka ci gaba","Building SPIKE represents 9 years of experience, learning, persistence and dedication.":"Building SPIKE represents 9 years na experience, learning, persistence da dedication.","Built on SPIKE, not copied from another platform.":"Built akan SPIKE, not copied daga another platform.","Business":"Business","CIRCLE CHAT":"CIRCLE CHAT","CONNECT • PASS • DISCOVER":"Haɗa • PASS • Gano","CONNECT • SHARE • DISCOVER":"HAƊA • RABA • GANO","CONTENTS":"CONTENTS","CREATE ROOM":"Ƙirƙira Ɗaki","CREATE ROOM ACCOUNT":"Ƙirƙira Ɗaki Asusun","CREATE YOUR SIGNAL":"Ƙirƙira Naka Sigina","CREATOR":"Mahalicci","CSC 101":"CSC 101","CURRENT SEASON":"CURRENT SEASON","CURRENT STREAK":"CURRENT Jerin nasara","Call supported friends, accept incoming calls, decline them, mute your microphone, toggle your camera and end the call.":"Kira ana tallafawa abokai, karɓa incoming calls, ƙi them, mute naka microphone, toggle naka camera da end na kira.","Calling…":"Calling…","Calls":"Calls","Camera":"Camera","Can I improve my ranking by paying?":"Iya I improve my matsayi by paying?","Cancel":"Soke","Canonical Policy Center":"Canonical Manufa Center","Carousel":"Carousel","Carry the message forward — with your own voice.":"Carry na saƙo forward — da naka own murya.","Cases":"Ƙararraki","Catch up on your recent activity without reading every individual event.":"Catch sama akan naka recent aiki without reading every individual event.","Category":"Category","Cell membranes":"Cell membranes","Cells & Life":"Cells & Life","Cells, genetics & life":"Cells, genetics & life","Chains":"Chains","Challenge":"ƙalubale","Challenge a friend, choose a topic, set the duration, then let the community vote.":"Challenge wani aboki, zaɓa wani topic, set na duration, then let na al’umma vote.","Challenge a friend. Everyone else can vote.":"Challenge wani aboki. Kowa else iya vote.","Change control":"Canza control","Change cover":"Canza cover","Change profile picture":"Canza bayanan martaba picture","Change theme":"Canza jigo","Changes apply after saving.":"Canje-canje apply after saving.","Changes are saved to your SPIKE account.":"Canje-canje su ajiye zuwa naka SPIKE asusun.","Changes are saved to your SPIKE profile.":"Canje-canje su ajiye zuwa naka SPIKE bayanan martaba.","Changes to enforcement-critical rules should be reviewed, logged and propagated to dependent moderation and recommendation systems before being treated as active.":"Canje-canje zuwa enforcement-critical dokoki should be reviewed, logged da propagated zuwa dependent tsari da recommendation systems kafin being treated as aiki.","Channel":"tashar","Chat":"Chat","Chat in a Room":"Chat a wani Ɗaki","Check XP, achievements or streaks occasionally rather than obsessing over every point.":"Duba XP, achievements ko streaks occasionally rather than obsessing over every point.","Check in":"Duba a","Check in once per day to maintain your streak. Eligible XP can receive a streak multiplier, and streak milestones can award bonus XP.":"Duba a once per day zuwa maintain naka jerin nasara. Cancanta XP iya receive wani jerin nasara multiplier, da jerin nasara milestones iya award bonus XP.","Check in today":"Duba a yau","Check in, complete daily tasks, earn XP, maintain a streak and unlock levels, ranks and achievements.":"Duba a, complete kullum tasks, earn XP, maintain wani jerin nasara da unlock levels, ranks da achievements.","Check in, review notifications, answer meaningful messages, and participate naturally.":"Duba a, bita sanarwa, answer meaningful saƙonni, da shiga naturally.","Check spam/junk folders, make sure the email address is correct, and use the resend option after its cooldown. Only the newest valid code should be used.":"Duba spam/junk folders, make sure na imel address ne correct, da yi amfani na resend option after its cooldown. Kawai na newest valid lamba should be used.","Check that you have an eligible connection, a stable internet connection, and the required microphone/camera browser permissions.":"Duba cewa kai have wani cancanta haɗi, wani stable internet haɗi, da na required microphone/camera burauza permissions.","Check your connection and refresh the conversation. If necessary, sign out and back in.":"Duba naka haɗi da sabunta na tattaunawa. If necessary, sa hannu out da baya a.","Check your connection, file type and size, then try again. If the issue continues, try an up-to-date browser.":"Duba naka haɗi, file type da size, then try again. If na issue continues, try wani sama-zuwa-date burauza.","Check your connection, refresh the current page, and reopen the conversation or Room. Live presence can change as people connect or disconnect.":"Duba naka haɗi, sabunta na current shafi, da reopen na tattaunawa ko Ɗaki. Live presence iya canza as mutane haɗa ko disconnect.","Check your connection, wait for the network to return, then retry. Avoid repeatedly submitting the same action while a connection is unstable.":"Duba naka haɗi, wait don na network zuwa return, then sake gwadawa. Avoid repeatedly submitting na same aiki while wani haɗi ne unstable.","Checking profile access…":"Checking bayanan martaba samun dama…","Checking status…":"Checking hali…","Checking your Room Account…":"Checking naka Ɗaki Asusun…","Checking your creator activity.":"Checking naka mahalicci aiki.","Child safety":"Child tsaro","Child sexual exploitation and sexualization of minors are prohibited. Suspected material should be handled through the highest-safety moderation path and appropriate escalation procedures.":"Child sexual exploitation da sexualization na minors su haramun. Suspected material should be handled ta hanyar na highest-tsaro tsari path da appropriate escalation procedures.","Choose Public, Friends or Private visibility where supported.":"Zaɓa Na jama’a, Abokai ko Na sirri gani ina ana tallafawa.","Choose a Room":"Zaɓa wani Ɗaki","Choose a channel, read the conversation and send messages. Replies, reactions and other actions appear when supported.":"Zaɓa wani channel, read na tattaunawa da aika saƙonni. Replies, reactions da sauran ayyuka appear lokacin ana tallafawa.","Choose a clear title and explain the goal.":"Zaɓa wani raba take da explain na goal.","Choose a friend":"Zaɓa wani aboki","Choose a friend.":"Zaɓa wani aboki.","Choose a friend…":"Zaɓa wani aboki…","Choose a username and add a profile picture and information you want people to see.":"Zaɓa wani username da add wani bayanan martaba picture da bayani kai so mutane zuwa see.","Choose an action for this media":"Zaɓa wani aiki don wannan kafofin watsa labarai","Choose cover photo":"Zaɓa cover photo","Choose the duration and launch.":"Zaɓa na duration da launch.","Choose the sign-up option on the welcome screen and follow the prompts. If you already have an account, simply sign in.":"Zaɓa na sa hannu-sama option akan na barka da zuwa screen da follow na prompts. If kai already have wani asusun, simply sa hannu a.","Choose the video call option and allow camera access when your browser asks.":"Zaɓa na video kira option da allow camera samun dama lokacin naka burauza asks.","Choose whether permitted people can see when you are online.":"Zaɓa whether permitted mutane iya see lokacin kai su kan layi.","Choose whether your profile can appear in discovery.":"Zaɓa whether naka bayanan martaba iya appear a ganowa.","Choose who can call you: Everyone, Friends or Nobody.":"Zaɓa waye iya kira kai: Kowa, Abokai ko Nobody.","Choose who can see, discover and interact with you.":"Zaɓa waye iya see, gano da interact da kai.","Choose who can start private conversations: Everyone, Friends or Nobody.":"Zaɓa waye iya fara na sirri tattaunawa: Kowa, Abokai ko Nobody.","Choose your coffee":"Zaɓa naka coffee","Choose your display name, email and password, agree to the displayed terms, then verify the email code.":"Zaɓa naka display suna, imel da kalmar sirri, agree zuwa na displayed sharuɗɗa, then verify na imel lamba.","Choose your goal":"Zaɓa naka goal","Choose your path":"Zaɓa naka path","Circle name":"Circle suna","Circles":"Circles","Circles are for real community. Do not spam messages or manufacture activity for progression. Community value comes first.":"Circles su don real al’umma. Do not spam saƙonni ko manufacture aiki don progression. Al’umma value comes first.","Classify":"Classify","Clean Sheet":"Clean Sheet","Clear":"raba","Clear all":"raba duk","Clear explanations with practical examples.":"raba explanations da practical examples.","Clear selected media":"raba selected kafofin watsa labarai","Clear, specific and enforceable":"raba, specific da enforceable","Close":"Rufe","Close Feature Center":"Rufe Feature Center","Close Friends":"Rufe Abokai","Close image viewer":"Rufe image viewer","Close menu":"Rufe menu","Close notification details":"Rufe notification details","Close profile":"Rufe bayanan martaba","Close scanner":"Rufe scanner","Close story":"Rufe labari","Close textbook":"Rufe textbook","Coins in wallets":"Coins a wallets","Coins, Gems, revenue-gated earning, ranking, streaks, pool and monthly cashouts.":"Coins, Gems, revenue-gated earning, matsayi, streaks, pool da monthly cashouts.","Collaborate":"Collaborate","Collaborative Signals":"Collaborative Signals","Collaborator user ID":"Collaborator mai amfani Shaida","Collection":"Collection","Collections & bookmarks":"Collections & bookmarks","Comments":"tsokaci","Community Missions":"Al’umma Missions","Community activities":"Al’umma activities","Community conduct":"Al’umma conduct","Community voters choose one side. Participants cannot vote in their own Battle. Votes are protected server-side and the Battle closes according to its rules.":"Al’umma voters zaɓa one side. Participants cannot vote a their own Battle. Votes su protected uwar garke-side da na Battle closes according zuwa its dokoki.","Compare picks":"Compare picks","Complete all 11 qualification requirements to unlock the Creator Tool.":"Complete duk 11 qualification requirements zuwa unlock na Mahalicci Tool.","Complete daily tasks, check in consistently, earn achievements and climb the level roadmap without farming activity.":"Complete kullum tasks, duba a consistently, earn achievements da climb na mataki roadmap without farming aiki.","Complete the displayed requirements":"Complete na displayed requirements","Complete the requirements below to unlock Room creation.":"Complete na requirements below zuwa unlock Ɗaki creation.","Complete the tasks shown in the Hub. Task names and rewards can change, so the live task card is the source of truth.":"Complete na tasks shown a na Hub. Task names da rewards iya canza, so na live task card ne na source na truth.","Complete useful daily tasks":"Complete mai amfani kullum tasks","Complete your profile":"Complete naka bayanan martaba","Computer Science":"Computer Science","Computing":"Computing","Confirm":"Tabbatar","Confirm Email":"Tabbatar Imel","Confirm action":"Tabbatar aiki","Confirm new password":"Tabbatar sabo kalmar sirri","Confirm password":"Tabbatar kalmar sirri","Confirm your email":"Tabbatar naka imel","Connect":"Haɗa","Connect and participate":"Haɗa da shiga","Connect instantly. No request or approval required.":"Haɗa instantly. A’a request ko approval required.","Connect people. Encourage expression. Give everyone a voice. Build something the world can acknowledge.":"Haɗa mutane. Encourage expression. Give kowa wani murya. Build something na duniya iya acknowledge.","Connect with people you actually want in your network. Follow up with meaningful conversation.":"Haɗa da mutane kai actually so a naka network. Follow sama da meaningful tattaunawa.","Connect • Share • Discover • Create • Participate • Grow":"Haɗa • Raba • Gano • Ƙirƙira • Shiga • Grow","Connecting":"Connecting","Connecting to the canonical SPIKE Policy Core…":"Connecting zuwa na canonical SPIKE Manufa Core…","Connecting…":"Connecting…","Connection issue.":"Haɗi issue.","Connection:":"Haɗi:","Connector":"Connector","Consistent rules, useful participation and respectful leadership":"Consistent dokoki, mai amfani participation da respectful leadership","Contact":"Tuntuɓi","Content":"Abun ciki","Content Admin":"Abun ciki Mai gudanarwa","Content Center":"Abun ciki Center","Content receiving the most activity.":"Abun ciki receiving na most aiki.","Content restriction or removal":"Abun ciki restriction ko removal","Content that creates serious safety risks may be removed immediately or escalated for review.":"Abun ciki cewa creates serious tsaro risks na iya be removed immediately ko escalated don bita.","Context and proportionality":"Context da proportionality","Continue":"Ci gaba","Continue learning":"Ci gaba learning","Continue to SPIKE":"Ci gaba zuwa SPIKE","Continue to room chat":"Ci gaba zuwa ɗaki chat","Continue with GitHub":"Ci gaba da GitHub","Continue with Google":"Ci gaba da Google","Continue →":"Ci gaba →","Contributor":"Contributor","Control center":"Control center","Control interactions":"Control interactions","Control who can see your posts":"Control waye iya see naka wallafe-wallafe","Control who can view your connections.":"Control waye iya duba naka connections.","Control who can view your posts and profile media.":"Control waye iya duba naka wallafe-wallafe da bayanan martaba kafofin watsa labarai.","Contr