","Daily check-in":"Kullum duba-a","Daily learning":"Kullum learning","Daily tasks":"Kullum tasks","Dashboard":"Dashboard","Day study streak":"Day study jerin nasara","Decision records":"Decision records","Decline":"Ƙi","Delete message":"Goge saƙo","Delete read":"Goge read","Delete story":"Goge labari","Delete the entire room":"Goge na entire ɗaki","Delete this message?":"Goge wannan saƙo?","Depending on the Room, you may find polls, events, announcements, moments, rules and member information.":"Depending akan na Ɗaki, kai na iya find ƙuri’u, events, announcements, moments, dokoki da mamba bayani.","Description":"Bayani","Desert Rose":"Desert Rose","Design rules":"Design dokoki","Detect":"Detect","Different for every member":"Different don every mamba","Digital":"Digital","Disable Maintenance":"Kashe Maintenance","Discover":"Gano","Discover People":"Gano Mutane","Discover Rooms":"Gano Ɗakuna","Discover people":"Gano mutane","Discover people, build genuine connections, message friends and participate in Rooms.":"Gano mutane, build genuine connections, saƙo abokai da shiga a Ɗakuna.","Discover registered SPIKE people you may want to connect with.":"Gano registered SPIKE mutane kai na iya so zuwa haɗa da.","Discoverable — anyone can join":"Discoverable — anyone iya shiga","Dismiss":"Dismiss","Dismissed":"Dismissed","Display name":"Display suna","Distribute the accumulated 15% pool to active users by streak multiplier.":"Distribute na accumulated 15% pool zuwa aiki masu amfani by jerin nasara multiplier.","Distribute today":"Distribute yau","Do not assume every action earns XP. Rewards and limits can change as SPIKE evolves, and server-side rules are authoritative.":"Do not assume every aiki earns XP. Rewards da limits iya canza as SPIKE evolves, da uwar garke-side dokoki su authoritative.","Do not coordinate fake accounts, spam voting, or attempt to manipulate the result. Repeated voting does not create unlimited progression.":"Do not coordinate fake accounts, spam voting, ko attempt zuwa manipulate na result. Repeated voting does not ƙirƙira unlimited progression.","Do not spam fake progress, automate clicks, create trivial high-tier challenges, or use multiple accounts to manufacture progression. SPIKE enforces reward tiers and mission difficulty on the server.":"Do not spam fake ci gaba, automate clicks, ƙirƙira trivial babba-tier challenges, ko yi amfani multiple accounts zuwa manufacture progression. SPIKE enforces reward tiers da mission difficulty akan na uwar garke.","Double Chance":"Double Chance","Download story media":"Download labari kafofin watsa labarai","Doxxing and privacy abuse":"Doxxing da sirri abuse","Draft stays on this device until you release it.":"Draft stays akan wannan device until kai release it.","Drafts":"Zayyana","Drafts & scheduling":"Zayyana & scheduling","Draw No Bet":"Draw A’a Bet","During a call":"During wani kira","EDU":"EDU","ELECHI OSOUNDU JOSHUA":"ELECHI OSOUNDU JOSHUA","ENGLISH":"ENGLISH","Each published policy revision receives a version identifier and effective date. Moderation decisions reference the version that governed the decision.":"Each published manufa revision receives wani version identifier da effective date. Tsari decisions reference na version cewa governed na decision.","Earn Room XP through messages, reactions, challenges and community activity.":"Earn Ɗaki XP ta hanyar saƙonni, reactions, challenges da al’umma aiki.","Earn XP":"Earn XP","Earn badges through real SPIKE activity.":"Earn badges ta hanyar real SPIKE aiki.","Earn progress":"Earn ci gaba","Easy":"Sauƙi","Edit":"Gyara","Edit only verified requirements. No manual completion control exists here.":"Gyara kawai verified requirements. A’a manual completion control exists here.","Edit profile":"Gyara bayanan martaba","Edit your profile":"Gyara naka bayanan martaba","Eligible activity can award XP, while streaks and tasks can add structured progression.":"Cancanta aiki iya award XP, while streaks da tasks iya add structured progression.","Eligible users can challenge an enforcement decision through the SPIKE appeal workflow.":"Cancanta masu amfani iya challenge wani enforcement decision ta hanyar na SPIKE ƙara workflow.","Elite":"Elite","Email":"Imel","Email address":"Imel address","Emerald Atelier":"Emerald Atelier","Emoji":"Emoji","Enable":"Kunna","Enable Maintenance":"Kunna Maintenance","Encouraging, glorifying or facilitating self-harm or suicide is prohibited. Supportive discussion and requests for help are not treated as equivalent to encouragement.":"Encouraging, glorifying ko facilitating self-harm ko suicide ne haramun. Supportive discussion da buƙatu don taimako su not treated as equivalent zuwa encouragement.","Encrypted session":"Encrypted session","End call":"End kira","End this session on this device.":"End wannan session akan wannan device.","Ends at (optional)":"Ends at (zaɓi ne)","Enforcement":"Enforcement","Enforcement & appeals":"Enforcement & appeals","Enforcement cases":"Enforcement ƙararraki","Enforcement evasion":"Enforcement evasion","Enforcement is tied to the policy violation and the severity, confidence and history of the case.":"Enforcement ne tied zuwa na manufa violation da na severity, amincewa da history na na ƙara.","Engagement":"Engagement","Engagement controls":"Engagement controls","Engagement totals":"Engagement totals","Engagement trend":"Engagement trend","Engineering":"Engineering","English Language":"English Harshe","Enter the newest code from your SPIKE email. Codes are temporary and can only be used once.":"Enter na newest lamba daga naka SPIKE imel. Codes su temporary da iya kawai be used once.","Enter your email and password, or use an available social sign-in option. Passwords are case-sensitive.":"Enter naka imel da kalmar sirri, ko yi amfani wani akwai social sa hannu-a option. Passwords su ƙara-sensitive.","Enter your email and we''ll send a secure recovery link.":"Enter naka imel da we''ll aika wani amintacce farfadowa mahada.","Epic":"Epic","Every award is recorded server-side.":"Every award ne recorded uwar garke-side.","Every broadcast is queued, batched, and audited.":"Every broadcast ne queued, batched, da audited.","Every cash-purchasable feature is submitted here as a request. Contact the user on WhatsApp, send the official bank details, verify the payment transaction, then approve to unlock or credit the purchase.":"Every cash-purchasable feature ne submitted here as wani request. Tuntuɓi na mai amfani akan WhatsApp, aika na official bank details, verify na payment transaction, then approve zuwa unlock ko credit na purchase.","Every enforcement action should retain its policy ID, policy version, action, decision source, timestamp and sufficient evidence for authorized review.":"Every enforcement aiki should retain its manufa Shaida, manufa version, aiki, decision source, timestamp da sufficient evidence don authorized bita.","Every mission must declare a metric + target. Progress is read from genuine message, Signal, Room, membership and Echo records. Completion is automatic. Weekly rewards are one-time per member/challenge. Achievements are one-time and server-unlocked.":"Every mission must declare wani metric + manufa. Ci gaba ne read daga genuine saƙo, Sigina, Ɗaki, membership da Echo records. Completion ne automatic. Mako-mako rewards su one-lokaci per mamba/challenge. Achievements su one-lokaci da uwar garke-unlocked.","Everyone":"Kowa","Everyone here can participate. Keep the conversation respectful.":"Kowa here iya shiga. Riƙe na tattaunawa respectful.","Everything you need to get the most out of SPIKE.":"Everything kai buƙata zuwa get na most out na SPIKE.","Everything you need, one tap away.":"Everything kai buƙata, one tap away.","Exam preparation":"Exam preparation","Existing Rooms are surfaced with current activity context.":"Existing Ɗakuna su surfaced da current aiki context.","Expand all":"Expand duk","Explain the context and why you believe the enforcement was incorrect.":"Explain na context da ni yasa kai believe na enforcement was incorrect.","Explain the decision.":"Explain na decision.","Explore":"Explore","Explore connected topics":"Explore connected topics","Explore courses →":"Explore kwasoshi →","Explore people, posts and topics beyond your usual feed.":"Explore mutane, wallafe-wallafe da topics beyond naka usual ciyarwa.","Explore personalized, discovery and trending content. Available feed views and sorting options help you find the posts you care about.":"Explore personalized, ganowa da trending abun ciki. Akwai ciyarwa kallo da sorting options taimako kai find na wallafe-wallafe kai care game da.","Explore profiles, suggestions and the Friends area to discover people you know or want to connect with.":"Explore profiles, suggestions da na Abokai area zuwa gano mutane kai know ko so zuwa haɗa da.","Explore relationships between your activity, communities and future discovery.":"Explore relationships between naka aiki, al’ummomi da future ganowa.","Explore the Feed":"Explore na Ciyarwa","Explorer":"Explorer","FAQ":"FAQ","FIXTURES":"FIXTURES","Fair play":"Adalci a wasa","Fair play and limits":"Adalci wasa da limits","Feed":"Ciyarwa","Feed & Stories":"Ciyarwa & Labarai","Feed & discovery":"Ciyarwa & ganowa","Feed controls":"Ciyarwa controls","Feed is for discovering and sharing; Messages are for private conversation; Rooms are for communities; Profile is for identity; Leveling is for progress.":"Ciyarwa ne don discovering da sharing; Saƙonni su don na sirri tattaunawa; Ɗakuna su don al’ummomi; Bayanan martaba ne don ainihi; Leveling ne don ci gaba.","Feed name":"Ciyarwa suna","Finance Admin":"Finance Mai gudanarwa","Find account":"Find asusun","Find an answer fast":"Find wani answer fast","Find communities and join the conversation.":"Find al’ummomi da shiga na tattaunawa.","Find content receiving strong current attention.":"Find abun ciki receiving strong current attention.","Find people":"Find mutane","Find people, send