ergy behind designing, testing da improving SPIKE.","Help navigation":"Taimako navigation","Help sections":"Taimako sections","Help turn a personal project into a platform people can connect and express themselves through.":"Taimako turn wani personal project into wani platform mutane iya haɗa da express themselves ta hanyar.","Hidden from members":"Hidden daga mambobi","Hide friends":"Hide abokai","Hide guide":"Hide jagora","High":"Babba","Highest confidence":"Highest amincewa","Home":"Gida","How do I contact someone privately?":"Yaya do I tuntuɓi someone privately?","How do I create a Story?":"Yaya do I ƙirƙira wani Labari?","How do I create a post?":"Yaya do I ƙirƙira wani wallafa?","How do I make a video call?":"Yaya do I make wani video kira?","How do Rooms work?":"Yaya do Ɗakuna work?","How many emojis they use":"Yaya many emojis they yi amfani","How membership works":"Yaya membership works","How people see you in Rooms":"Yaya mutane see kai a Ɗakuna","How to continue":"Yaya zuwa ci gaba","How to create one":"Yaya zuwa ƙirƙira one","How to rank up":"Yaya zuwa rank sama","How to start":"Yaya zuwa fara","I agree to the Terms and Privacy Policy":"I agree zuwa na Sharuɗɗa da Sirri Manufa","I cannot send a Room message.":"I cannot aika wani Ɗaki saƙo.","I did not receive a verification code.":"I did not receive wani verification lamba.","I forgot my password.":"I manta my kalmar sirri.","I forgot my password. What do I do?":"I manta my kalmar sirri. Menene do I do?","I wanted to bring people together and create a place where people can connect, communicate, speak out and be heard — including a platform where people can speak about corruption and challenges facing Nigeria.":"I wanted zuwa bring mutane together da ƙirƙira wani place ina mutane iya haɗa, communicate, speak out da be heard — including wani platform ina mutane iya speak game da corruption da challenges facing Nigeria.","If Room creation is available to your account, follow the creation flow and complete any steps shown on screen.":"If Ɗaki creation ne akwai zuwa naka asusun, follow na creation flow da complete any steps shown akan screen.","If a page reports an expired or invalid session, return to the sign-in screen and authenticate again before retrying the action.":"If wani shafi reports wani expired ko invalid session, return zuwa na sa hannu-a screen da authenticate again kafin retrying na aiki.","If something violates community expectations, use the available report option instead of engaging with it.":"If something violates al’umma expectations, yi amfani na akwai ba da rahoto option instead na engaging da it.","If you forget your password, use the recovery option on the sign-in screen and follow the instructions.":"If kai forget naka kalmar sirri, yi amfani na farfadowa option akan na sa hannu-a screen da follow na instructions.","If your goal is to become a consistently high-ranking, high-quality SPIKE member, optimize for genuine value rather than tricks.":"If naka goal ne zuwa become wani consistently babba-matsayi, babba-quality SPIKE mamba, optimize don genuine value rather than tricks.","Ignore every report":"Ignore every ba da rahoto","Ignore it":"Ignore it","Image viewer":"Image viewer","Impersonating another person, organization or SPIKE administrator in a way that deceives or harms others is prohibited.":"Impersonating another person, organization ko SPIKE administrator a wani way cewa deceives ko harms wasu ne haramun.","Impersonation and deceptive identity":"Impersonation da deceptive ainihi","Important SPIKE update":"Important SPIKE update","Incoming call":"Incoming kira","Incoming call ringtone":"Incoming kira ringtone","Individual actions on your content.":"Individual ayyuka akan naka abun ciki.","Influencer":"Influencer","Info":"Info","Insights":"Insights","Interact with posts":"Interact da wallafe-wallafe","Interaction rate":"Interaction rate","Introduction to Computing":"Introduction zuwa Computing","Invite another SPIKE user to co-create a Signal.":"Invite another SPIKE mai amfani zuwa co-ƙirƙira wani Sigina.","It represents connection, communication, expression and giving people a voice.":"It represents haɗi, communication, expression da giving mutane wani murya.","JAMB":"JAMB","Join Room":"Shiga Ɗaki","Join a Room":"Shiga wani Ɗaki","Join an active mission, then record progress when your contribution genuinely moves the shared goal forward. Progress and completion are checked by SPIKE''s server.":"Shiga wani aiki mission, then record ci gaba lokacin naka contribution genuinely moves na shared goal forward. Ci gaba da completion su checked by SPIKE''s uwar garke.","Join conversations, discover people, and find Rooms around the topics you love.":"Shiga tattaunawa, gano mutane, da find Ɗakuna around na topics kai love.","Join discussions, answer questions, react thoughtfully and contribute to community events or polls.":"Shiga discussions, answer questions, react thoughtfully da contribute zuwa al’umma events ko ƙuri’u.","Join focused communities, participate in discussions, polls and events, and follow Room activity.":"Shiga focused al’ummomi, shiga a discussions, ƙuri’u da events, da follow Ɗaki aiki.","Join room":"Shiga ɗaki","Join this room to chat":"Shiga wannan ɗaki zuwa chat","Join this room to chat…":"Shiga wannan ɗaki zuwa chat…","Join your room":"Shiga naka ɗaki","Joined":"Shiga","Joining a Room":"Joining wani Ɗaki","Keep conversations simple, organized and personal.":"Riƙe tattaunawa simple, organized da personal.","Keep improving":"Riƙe improving","Keep it going":"Riƙe it going","Keep it handy:":"Riƙe it handy:","Keep login, payment confirmation, admin access, and emergency support paths available while the main application is in maintenance mode.":"Riƙe shiga, payment confirmation, mai gudanarwa samun dama, da emergency support paths akwai while na main application ne a maintenance mode.","Keep message":"Riƙe saƙo","Keep terms contextual and review false-positive risk before enabling re