y ci gaba approachable but makes higher levels increasingly demanding: Mataki 10 requires 6,000 XP da Mataki 100 requires 310,000 XP. Intermediate thresholds rise progressively between those milestones. Existing earned levels su protected daga regression lokacin na curve canje-canje; future mataki-ups yi amfani na harder roadmap.","Leveling V3:":"Leveling V3:","Levels":"Levels","Levels belong to rank bands such as Newcomer, Explorer, Connector, Contributor, Influencer, Elite, Leader, Pioneer, Trailblazer and SPIKE Legend.":"Levels belong zuwa rank bands such as Newcomer, Explorer, Connector, Contributor, Influencer, Elite, Leader, Pioneer, Trailblazer da SPIKE Legend.","Library":"Library","Likes":"So","Live activity":"Live aiki","Live backend health and economy snapshot.":"Live backend lafiya da economy snapshot.","Live clusters of conversations forming around the same topic.":"Live clusters na tattaunawa forming around na same topic.","Live communities on SPIKE":"Live al’ummomi akan SPIKE","Live data looks stale":"Live data looks stale","Live room chat":"Live ɗaki chat","Live status is shared across SPIKE.":"Live hali ne shared across SPIKE.","Live vocabulary used by the server-side Policy Engine.":"Live vocabulary used by na uwar garke-side Manufa Engine.","Load older messages":"Load older saƙonni","Loading Moments…":"Ana lodawa Moments…","Loading SPIKE":"Ana lodawa SPIKE","Loading SPIKE feed":"Ana lodawa SPIKE ciyarwa","Loading SPIKE profile":"Ana lodawa SPIKE bayanan martaba","Loading SPIKE…":"Ana lodawa SPIKE…","Loading XP…":"Ana lodawa XP…","Loading analytics…":"Ana lodawa analytics…","Loading appeals…":"Ana lodawa appeals…","Loading cashouts…":"Ana lodawa cashouts…","Loading channels…":"Ana lodawa channels…","Loading creator insights…":"Ana lodawa mahalicci insights…","Loading engagement…":"Ana lodawa engagement…","Loading feature purchases…":"Ana lodawa feature purchases…","Loading image":"Ana lodawa image","Loading invites…":"Ana lodawa invites…","Loading n