onnections, creation, engagement and streaks.":"Milestones recognize meaningful ci gaba such as levels, connections, creation, engagement da streaks.","Minimum 3 Gems · maximum 5 Gems/month · 10% fee · payout on the 1st.":"Minimum 3 Gems · maximum 5 Gems/month · 10% fee · payout akan na 1st.","Mission":"manufa","Mission difficulty":"manufa difficulty","Mission title":"Mission take","Missions":"manufofi","Missions, challenges and achievements unlock only from server-verified activity.":"Missions, challenges da achievements unlock kawai daga uwar garke-verified aiki.","Model estimate, not probability of certainty.":"Model estimate, not probability na certainty.","Moderation":"Tsari","Moderation Admin":"Tsari Mai gudanarwa","Moderation decisions should be explainable and auditable.":"Tsari decisions should be explainable da auditable.","Moderation, recommendation safety, notifications, appeals and administrative tools should reference this policy framework and its version rather than maintaining conflicting copies of the rules.":"Tsari, recommendation tsaro, sanarwa, appeals da administrative tools should reference wannan manufa framework da its version rather than maintaining conflicting copies na na dokoki.","Moments":"Moments","Monthly Coins":"Monthly Coins","More":"Ƙari","More features":"Ƙari features","More uncertainty. Compare other markets.":"Ƙari uncertainty. Compare sauran markets.","Mute microphone":"Mute microphone","Muted keywords, comma separated":"Muted keywords, comma separated","My Room chat is not updating.":"My Ɗaki chat ne not updating.","My Rooms":"My Ɗakuna","My SPIKE Dashboard":"My SPIKE Dashboard","My SPIKE QR":"My SPIKE QR","My XP or rank looks wrong.":"My XP ko rank looks wrong.","My subjects":"My subjects","Name":"Suna","Name the chain":"Suna na chain","Nearby discovery is opt-in. Posts need location data to appear here.":"Nearby ganowa ne opt-a. Wallafe-wallafe buƙata location data zuwa appear here.","Nearby remains opt-in. This upgrade keeps