uests can be managed from Friends.":"Buɗe someone''s bayanan martaba da yi amfani na akwai haɗi option. Pending buƙatu iya be managed daga Abokai.","Open textbook →":"Buɗe textbook →","Open the Stories row to view updates. Move through stories, interact and reply when those options are available.":"Buɗe na Labarai row zuwa duba updates. Move ta hanyar labarai, interact da reply lokacin those options su akwai.","Open the device share sheet or copy a private story link.":"Buɗe na device raba sheet ko kwafi wani na sirri labari mahada.","Open to load your Reputation.":"Buɗe zuwa load naka Reputation.","Open your profile QR option to display a code that another person can scan to quickly find and connect with you.":"Buɗe naka bayanan martaba QR option zuwa display wani lamba cewa another person iya scan zuwa quickly find da haɗa da kai.","Opening SPIKE Room Chat…":"Opening SPIKE Ɗaki Chat…","Opening the shared SPIKE content…":"Opening na shared SPIKE abun ciki…","Opt-in local discovery. Location-based posts need location data to appear.":"Opt-a local ganowa. Location-based wallafe-wallafe buƙata location data zuwa appear.","Optional Signal ID":"Zaɓi ne Sigina Shaida","Optional details…":"Zaɓi ne details…","Optional note…":"Zaɓi ne note…","Optional room rules":"Zaɓi ne ɗaki dokoki","Optional root Signal ID":"Zaɓi ne root Sigina Shaida","Optional social links":"Zaɓi ne social links","Optionally attach a root Signal.":"Optionally attach wani root Sigina.","Optionally connect a Signal.":"Optionally haɗa wani Sigina.","Order":"Order","Orders stay pending until payment verification is connected.":"Orders stay pending until payment verification ne connected.","Organize your chats":"Organize naka chats","Other":"Sauran","Outgoing call ringtone":"Outgoing kira ringtone","Over 0.5":"Over 0.5","Over 1.5":"Over 1.5","Over 2.5":"Over 2.5","Over 3.5":"Over 3.5","Overview":"Overview","Owners can invite friends. Members can join, leave and open the Circle chat according to the Circle''