,"Platform abuse":"Platform abuse","Play incoming.mp3 when a call arrives.":"Wasa incoming.mp3 lokacin wani kira arrives.","Play notifications.mp3 for new messages.":"Wasa sanarwa.mp3 don sabo saƙonni.","Play outgoing.mp3 while calling.":"Wasa outgoing.mp3 while calling.","Please confirm":"Please tabbatar","Point your camera at a SPIKE QR code":"Point naka camera at wani SPIKE QR lamba","Policy & Appeals":"Manufa & Appeals","Policy Center":"Manufa Center","Policy Core":"Manufa Core","Policy ID":"Manufa Shaida","Policy IDs are stable references":"Manufa IDs su stable references","Policy IDs shown here are canonical references for future SPIKE moderation, recommendation-safety, notification, appeal and administration systems. This page is the canonical SPIKE policy reference. Enforcement is implemented server-side and this page does not replace applicable law or the SPIKE Terms of Service.":"Manufa IDs shown here su canonical references don future SPIKE tsari, recommendation-tsaro, notification, ƙara da administration systems. Wannan shafi ne na canonical SPIKE manufa reference. Enforcement ne implemented uwar garke-side da wannan shafi does not replace applicable law ko na SPIKE Sharuɗɗa na Service.","Policy changes":"Manufa canje-canje","Policy changes must be versioned so historical decisions remain interpretable.":"Manufa canje-canje must be versioned so historical decisions remain interpretable.","Policy moderation sections":"Manufa tsari sections","Policy sections":"Manufa sections","Policy version 1.0":"Manufa version 1.0","Polish":"Polish","Polish a draft, add a hook, shorten it or suggest hashtags.":"Polish wani draft, add wani hook, shorten it ko suggest hashtags.","Polls":"Ƙuri’u","Popular":"Popular","Possible actions":"Possible ayyuka","Post IDs, comma separated":"Wallafa IDs, comma separated","Post ideas, stories, media or links that give people a reason to stop, read and return.":"Wallafa ideas, labarai, kafofin watsa labarai ko links cewa give mutane wani reason zuwa stop, read da return.","Post image":"Wallafa image","Post, connect and participate to grow your profile.":"Wallafa, haɗa da shiga zuwa grow naka bayanan martaba.","Post, connect, converse, join communities and complete useful tasks.":"Wallafa, haɗa, converse, shiga al’ummomi da complete mai amfani tasks.","Posts":"Wallafe-wallafe","Posts & media":"Wallafe-wallafe & kafofin watsa labarai","Posts visibility":"Wallafe-wallafe gani","Posts, media & stories":"Wallafe-wallafe, kafofin watsa labarai & labarai","Power the build":"Power na build","Predict smarter. Follow every fixture.":"Predict smarter. Follow every fixture.","Prediction markets":"Prediction markets","Predictions & matches":"Predictions & matches","Predictions are model estimates, not guarantees. Missing fixtures or markets simply means the relevant data is not currently available.":"Predictions su model estimates, not guarantees. Missing fixtures ko markets simply means na relevant data ne not currently akwai.","Predictions can be wrong. Treat confidence as information, not certainty, and never risk money you cannot afford to lose.":"Predictions iya be wrong. Treat amincewa as bayani, not certainty, da never risk money kai cannot afford zuwa lose.","Predictor":"Mai hasashe","Prefer quality posts and genuine relationships over repetitive engagement.":"Prefer quality wallafe-wallafe da genuine relationships over repetitive engagement.","Preparing your sign-in experience…":"Preparing naka sa hannu-a experience…","Preview selected media, add more items, rotate, filter, crop, mute video and choose a layout.":"Preview selected kafofin watsa labarai, add ƙari items, rotate, filter, crop, mute video da zaɓa wani layout.","Previous":"Previous","Previous image":"Previous image","Previous story":"Previous labari","Price in Coins":"Price a Coins","Principles":"Principles","Print":"Print","Prioritize thoughtful introductions and relationships rather than collecting connections for a number.":"Prioritize thoughtful introductions da relationships rather than collecting connections don wani number.","Privacy":"Sirri","Privacy & Access":"Sirri & Samun dama","Privacy & access":"Sirri & samun dama","Privacy & protection":"Sirri & protection","Privacy & safety":"Sirri & tsaro","Privacy settings reduce exposure; they cannot control what another person does with information you voluntarily send them. Think before sharing passwords, codes, financial details, private documents or sensitive personal information.":"Sirri saituna reduce exposure; they cannot control menene another person does da bayani kai voluntarily aika them. Think kafin sharing passwords, codes, financial details, na sirri documents ko sensitive personal bayani.","Private":"Na sirri","Private Circles are invitation-only. Discoverable Circles can be joined by eligible users.":"Na sirri Circles su invitation-kawai. Discoverable Circles iya be shiga by cancanta masu amfani.","Private Messages":"Na sirri Saƙonni","Private audience":"Na sirri audience","Private communications":"Na sirri communications","Private information":"Na sirri bayani","Private message":"Na sirri saƙo","Private messages":"Na sirri saƙonni","Private messages and private community data should not be exposed through public recommendation, search or administrative interfaces except where an authorized safety or legal workflow requires access.":"Na sirri saƙonni da na sirri al’umma data should not be exposed ta hanyar na jama’a recommendation, bincika ko administrative interfaces except ina wani authorized tsaro ko legal workflow requires samun dama.","Private messaging is designed for one-to-one conversations with your friends and supported connections.":"Na sirri messaging ne designed don one-zuwa-one tattaunawa da naka abokai da ana tallafawa connections.","Private to the profile owner.":"Na sirri zuwa na bayanan martaba owner.","Private vs discoverable":"Na sirri vs discoverable","Private — invite friends":"Na sirri — invite abokai","Product title":"Product take","Profile":"Bayanan martaba","Profile discovery":"Bayanan martaba ganowa","Profile keeps loading":"Bayanan martaba keeps ana lodawa","Profile options":"Bayanan martaba options","Profile views":"Bayanan martaba kallo","Profile visibility":"Ganin bayanan martaba","Profiles":"bayanan martaba","Progress is calculated from real activity.":"Ci gaba ne calculated daga real aiki.","Progress is computed from real activity during the challenge window.":"Ci gaba ne computed daga real aiki during na challenge taga.","Progression follows authoritative XP thresholds.":"Progression follows authoritative XP thresholds.","Progression loop":"Progression loop","Prohibited catalog":"Haramun catalog","Prohibited term catalog":"Haramun term catalog","Prohibited words and phrases":"Haramun words da phrases","Protect your account":"Protect naka asusun","Protected recovery":"Protected farfadowa","Public":"Na jama’a","Public Rooms are community spaces. Follow the displayed rules, avoid spam/scams/harassment, and use report tools when something genuinely violates the rules.":"Na jama’a Ɗakuna su al’umma spaces. Follow na displayed dokoki, avoid spam/scams/harassment, da yi amfani ba da rahoto tools lokacin something genuinely violates na dokoki.","Public identity on SPIKE":"Na jama’a ainihi akan SPIKE","Public posts":"Na jama’a wallafe-wallafe","Publicly shame the reporter":"Publicly shame na reporter","Publish":"Publish","Publish Mission":"Publish manufa","Publish consistently, improve your profile, learn what your audience values and build a recognizable voice.":"Publish consistently, improve naka bayanan martaba, learn menene naka audience values da build wani recognizable murya.","Publish only when the goal is clear and achievable.":"Publish kawai lokacin na goal ne raba da achievable.","Publish something useful, answer a question, help in a Room or have a genuine conversation.":"Publish something mai amfani, answer wani question, taimako a wani Ɗaki ko have wani genuine tattaunawa.","Published":"Published","Publishing or soliciting highly sensitive personal information for harassment, intimidation or harm is prohibited.":"Publishing ko soliciting highly sensitive personal bayani don harassment, intimidation ko harm ne haramun.","Publishing your story…":"Publishing naka labari…","Put something into the world. Make it worth hearing.":"Put something into na duniya. Make it worth hearing.","QR connection":"QR haɗi","QUICK HELP":"QUICK Taimako","Quality beats volume. A clear idea, useful caption and relevant media usually create a better experience than posting repeatedly just to increase activity.":"Quality beats volume. Wani raba idea, mai amfani caption da relevant kafofin watsa labarai usually ƙirƙira wani better experience than posting repeatedly just zuwa increase aiki.","Quality test:":"Quality test:","Queue & Send":"Queue & Aika","Quick actions for this profile.":"Quick ayyuka don wannan bayanan martaba.","Quick answers when something doesn''t go as expected.":"Quick answers lokacin something doesn''t go as expected.","Quick check":"Quick duba","Quick coffee":"Quick coffee","Quick links":"Quick links","Quick review":"Quick bita","RELEASE":"RELEASE","ROOM":"Ɗaki","ROOMS ADMIN":"Ɗakuna Mai gudanarwa","Rank":"Rank","Ranked by confidence":"Ranked by amincewa","Ranking & visibility":"Matsayi & gani","React, Echo, Pass and Keep Signals using the actions shown on each Signal.":"React, Echo, Pass da Riƙe Signals using na ayyuka shown akan each Sigina.","Reactions":"Reactions","Read the existing entries, then add a meaningful continuation. Entries keep their parent-child relationship so the history stays understandable.":"Read na existing entries, then add wani meaningful continuation. Entries riƙe their parent-child relationship so na history stays understandable.","Ready to preview":"Ready zuwa preview","Ready when your voice is ready.":"Ready lokacin naka murya ne ready.","Recalculate levels":"Recalculate levels","Recent Broadcasts":"Recent Broadcasts","Recent room activity will appear here when activity data is available.":"Recent ɗaki aiki will appear here lokacin aiki data ne akwai.","Recommendation systems must apply policy safety before ranking content for distribution.":"Recommendation systems must apply manufa tsaro kafin matsayi abun ciki don distribution.","Recommendations":"Recommendations","Recommended next":"Recommended na gaba","Recommended pipeline: publish/edit → server moderation → remove or review when required → privacy/access checks → personal mute filtering → candidate generation → safety eligibility → ranking → feed.":"Recommended pipeline: publish/gyara → uwar garke tsari → cire ko bita lokacin required → sirri/samun dama checks → personal mute filtering → candidate generation → tsaro eligibility → matsayi → ciyarwa.","Recommended safety behavior":"Recommended tsaro behavior","Record a voice note, review the recording state, cancel if needed, and send.":"Record wani murya note, bita na recording state, soke if needed, da aika.","Recording voice note…":"Recording murya note…","Recover a member only with their current Personal Safety Code. Verification and recovery authorization are server-controlled.":"Recover wani mamba kawai da their current Personal Tsaro Lamba. Verification da farfadowa authorization su uwar garke-controlled.","Recovery link":"Farfadowa mahada","Recruitment, operational support, credible praise intended to advance violent extremist activity and instructions that facilitate violent extremist acts are prohibited.":"Recruitment, operational support, credible praise intended zuwa advance violent extremist aiki da instructions cewa facilitate violent extremist acts su haramun.","Refresh":"Sabunta","Refresh Top Picks":"Sabunta Top Picks","Refresh admins":"Sabunta admins","Refresh engagement":"Sabunta engagement","Refresh intelligence":"Sabunta intelligence","Refresh notifications":"Sabunta sanarwa","Refresh room":"Sabunta ɗaki","Refresh the Gamification Hub. Progress is authoritative to the live gamification system, so do not rely on a manually calculated total.":"Sabunta na Gamification Hub. Ci gaba ne authoritative zuwa na live gamification tsari, so do not rely akan wani manually calculated total.","Refresh the Notifications page. If SPIKE asks you to sign in again, your saved session may no longer be valid.":"Sabunta na Sanarwa shafi. If SPIKE asks kai zuwa sa hannu a again, naka ajiye session na iya a’a longer be valid.","Registration is owner-only. The new account automatically receives its SPIKE profile, wallet and generated SP_ID through the existing Auth triggers.":"Registration ne owner-kawai. Na sabo asusun automatically receives its SPIKE bayanan martaba, wallet da generated SP_Shaida ta hanyar na existing Auth triggers.","Rejected":"Rejected","Release time":"Release lokaci","Remember me":"Remember ni","Remember what the model means":"Remember menene na model means","Remove":"Cire","Remove, restrict or review.":"Cire, restrict ko bita.","Removed or restricted content must not enter recommendation candidates. Policy eligibility is checked before personalization and ranking signals are applied.":"Removed ko restricted abun ciki must not enter recommendation candidates. Manufa eligibility ne checked kafin personalization da matsayi signals su applied.","Repeat infringement":"Repeat infringement","Repeat your new password":"Repeat naka sabo kalmar sirri","Repeat your password":"Repeat naka kalmar sirri","Repeated valid copyright violations may result in escalating account enforcement under applicable law and SPIKE''s terms.":"Repeated valid copyright violations na iya result a escalating asusun enforcement under applicable law da SPIKE''s sharuɗɗa.","Reply":"Reply","Reply to a message and follow conversation threads.":"Reply zuwa wani saƙo da follow tattaunawa threads.","Reply, react, edit supported messages, pin, save/unsave, translate, copy, delete and report.":"Reply, react, gyara ana tallafawa saƙonni, liƙa, ajiye/unsave, fassara, kwafi, goge da ba da rahoto.","Report":"Ba da rahoto","Report Signal":"Ba da rahoto Sigina","Report Signals, messages or Room content when appropriate. You can also block users. In Rooms, follow the displayed rules and use moderation/report flows rather than escalating conflict.":"Ba da rahoto Signals, saƙonni ko Ɗaki abun ciki lokacin appropriate. Kai iya also toshe masu amfani. A Ɗakuna, follow na displayed dokoki da yi amfani tsari/ba da rahoto flows rather than escalating conflict.","Report content":"Ba da rahoto abun ciki","Report inappropriate posts, profiles, messages or Room activity using the relevant report control.":"Ba da rahoto inappropriate wallafe-wallafe, profiles, saƙonni ko Ɗaki aiki using na relevant ba da rahoto control.","Report message":"Ba da rahoto saƙo","Reputation":"Reputation","Reputation, discovery, memory & insights":"Reputation, ganowa, memory & insights","Resend Code":"Resend Lamba","Reset":"Sake saita","Reset your password":"Sake saita naka kalmar sirri","Resource":"Resource","Respect the Room":"Respect na Ɗaki","Respond to the people and conversations that actually deserve your attention.":"Respond zuwa na mutane da tattaunawa cewa actually deserve naka attention.","Restored":"Restored","Restrict":"Restrict","Resume":"Ci gaba","Resume Center":"Ci gaba Center","Retest anytime":"Retest anytime","Retry":"Sake gwadawa","Return to Rooms you already joined.":"Return zuwa Ɗakuna kai already shiga.","Return to unfinished SPIKE work without losing your place.":"Return zuwa unfinished SPIKE work without losing naka place.","Revenue today":"Revenue yau","Review":"Bita","Review Policy":"Bita Manufa","Review Settings after major changes to your life, audience or comfort level.":"Bita Saituna after major canje-canje zuwa naka life, audience ko comfort mataki.","Review automated SPIKE Policy actions, see the policy reference attached to each case, and submit one active appeal per enforcement case.":"Bita automated SPIKE Manufa ayyuka, see na manufa reference attached zuwa each ƙara, da submit one aiki ƙara per enforcement ƙara.","Review drafts, scheduled content and published performance.":"Bita zayyana, scheduled abun ciki da published performance.","Review incoming requests and accept or decline them. You can also manage requests you have sent.":"Bita incoming buƙatu da karɓa ko ƙi them. Kai iya also sarrafa buƙatu kai have sent.","Review mentions, social activity, connection activity and other account events.":"Bita mentions, social aiki, haɗi aiki da sauran asusun events.","Review notifications":"Bita sanarwa","Review pending requests and accept or decline them.":"Bita pending buƙatu da karɓa ko ƙi them.","Review pending user appeals without exposing moderation internals to clients.":"Bita pending mai amfani appeals without exposing tsari internals zuwa clients.","Review removals, holds and restoration decisions.":"Bita removals, holds da restoration decisions.","Review states":"Bita states","Review the model''s projected score, confidence information and available markets before deciding what to save.":"Bita na model''s projected score, amincewa bayani da akwai markets kafin deciding menene zuwa ajiye.","Review weak areas":"Bita weak areas","Review your live qualification status.":"Bita naka live qualification hali.","Review your profile, clean saved items, join useful Room discussions and check your progress.":"Bita naka bayanan martaba, clean ajiye items, shiga mai amfani Ɗaki discussions da duba naka ci gaba.","Review your progress":"Bita naka ci gaba","Rights to uploaded material":"Rights zuwa uploaded material","Role":"Matsayi","Room":"Ɗaki","Room Account":"Ɗaki Asusun","Room Guide":"Ɗaki Jagora","Room ID:":"Ɗaki Shaida:","Room Moments":"Ɗaki Moments","Room activity":"Ɗaki aiki","Room channels":"Ɗaki channels","Room chat":"Ɗaki chat","Room cover":"Ɗaki cover","Room creation":"Ɗaki creation","Room creation is a creator feature. The Creator area shows your live qualification progress and the requirements needed to unlock the Creator Tool, including an account-age requirement and a creator challenge. The exact live checklist shown in the app is authoritative.":"Ɗaki creation ne wani mahalicci feature. Na Mahalicci area shows naka live qualification ci gaba da na requirements needed zuwa unlock na Mahalicci Tool, including wani asusun-age requirement da wani mahalicci challenge. Na exact live checklist shown a na app ne authoritative.","Room feature requests":"Ɗaki feature buƙatu","Room handle":"Ɗaki handle","Room information":"Ɗaki bayani","Room management":"Ɗaki management","Room picture":"Ɗaki picture","Room sections":"Ɗaki sections","Room unavailable":"Ɗaki unavailable","Room views":"Ɗaki kallo","Rooms":"Ɗakuna","Rooms are public community spaces organized around topics and shared activity.":"Ɗakuna su na jama’a al’umma spaces organized around topics da shared aiki.","Royal Amethyst":"Royal Amethyst","Rules":"Dokoki","Rules & platform standards":"Dokoki & platform standards","S":"S","SERVER-VERIFIED PROGRESSION":"Uwar garke-VERIFIED PROGRESSION","SIGN IN":"Sa hannu A","SIGNAL MEDIA":"Sigina Kafofin watsa labarai","SMART GUIDE · START HERE":"SMART Jagora · Fara HERE","SP ID":"SP Shaida","SP-••••••":"SP-••••••","SPIKE":"SPIKE","SPIKE ACTION":"SPIKE Aiki","SPIKE ACTIVITY":"SPIKE Aiki","SPIKE Admin":"SPIKE Mai gudanarwa","SPIKE Battles":"SPIKE Battles","SPIKE Builder powered":"SPIKE Builder powered","SPIKE CREATOR CENTER":"SPIKE Mahalicci CENTER","SPIKE Circles":"SPIKE Circles","SPIKE Community Policy":"SPIKE Al’umma Manufa","SPIKE Complete Guide":"SPIKE Complete Jagora","SPIKE Connect instantly":"SPIKE Haɗa instantly","SPIKE EDU":"SPIKE EDU","SPIKE EDU home":"SPIKE EDU gida","SPIKE EDU turns a big syllabus into small, clear study sessions — then helps you practise, check your understanding and return to weak areas.":"SPIKE EDU turns wani big syllabus into small, raba study sessions — then helps kai practise, duba naka understanding da 