pp. It ne wani 9-shekara journey na learning, persistence da dedication — built zuwa haɗa mutane, encourage expression da give kowa wani murya.","SPIKE logo":"SPIKE logo","SPIKE may maintain a server-side prohibited-term policy list. Terms are detection signals mapped to policy IDs; a match may trigger automatic blocking when the rule is unambiguous, or contextual review when meaning depends on surrounding content.":"SPIKE na iya maintain wani uwar garke-side haramun-term manufa list. Sharuɗɗa su detection signals mapped zuwa manufa IDs; wani match na iya trigger automatic blocking lokacin na rule ne unambiguous, ko contextual bita lokacin meaning depends akan surrounding abun ciki.","SPIKE may restrict or remove content that falls within defined prohibited categories.":"SPIKE na iya restrict ko cire abun ciki cewa falls within defined haramun categories.","SPIKE member":"SPIKE mamba","SPIKE navigation":"SPIKE navigation","SPIKE new features":"SPIKE sabo features","SPIKE profile":"SPIKE bayanan martaba","SPIKE sets the challenge target and time window for that tier.":"SPIKE sets na challenge manufa da lokaci taga don cewa tier.","SPIKE should prioritize user safety while minimizing unnecessary removals, discriminatory enforcement and avoidable false positives.":"SPIKE should prioritize mai amfani tsaro while minimizing unnecessary removals, discriminatory enforcement da avoidable false positives.","SPIKE should protect private information and respect access boundaries.":"SPIKE should protect na sirri bayani da respect samun dama boundaries.","SPIKE supports text posts, photos, videos, links and 24-hour Stories.":"SPIKE supports text wallafe-wallafe, photos, videos, links da 24-hour Labarai.","SPIKE was inspired by the word":"SPIKE was inspired by na word","SPIKE · Progression":"SPIKE · Progression","SPIKE · World":"SPIKE · Duniya","SPIKE — Engagement":"SPIKE — Engagement","SPIKE — Feed":"SPIKE — Ciyarwa","SPIKE — Help Center":"SPIKE — Taimako Center","SPIKE — Messages":"SPIKE — Saƙonni","SPIKE — Notifications":"SPIKE — Sanarwa","SPIKE — Policy & Appeals":"SPIKE — Manufa & Appeals","SPIKE — Private Message":"SPIKE — Na sirri Saƙo","SPIKE — Profile":"SPIKE — Bayanan martaba","SPIKE — Reset Password":"SPIKE — Sake saita Kalmar sirri","SPIKE — Rooms":"SPIKE — Ɗakuna","SPIKE — Settings":"SPIKE — Saituna","SPIKE — Shared":"SPIKE — Shared","SPIKE — Sign in":"SPIKE — Sa hannu a","SPIKE — The Complete Member Guide":"SPIKE — Na Complete Mamba Jagora","SPIKE • FOUNDER & SUPPORT":"SPIKE • FOUNDER & SUPPORT","SPIKE • Founder & Support":"SPIKE • Founder & Support","SPIKE • Member Guide":"SPIKE • Mamba Jagora","SPIKE • Support page":"SPIKE • Support shafi","SPIKE''s Creator area is designed for members who want to build communities rather than only participate in them.":"SPIKE''s Mahalicci area ne designed don mambobi waye so zuwa build al’ummomi rather than kawai shiga a them.","SPIKE''s Help Assistant is designed to answer questions using information available inside SPIKE. It runs without an external AI API.":"SPIKE''s Taimako Assistant ne designed zuwa answer questions using bayani akwai inside SPIKE. It runs without wani external AI API.","SPIKE''s progression systems are easiest to understand as one connected loop.":"SPIKE''s progression systems su easiest zuwa understand as one connected loop.","SPIKE, at a glance":"SPIKE, at wani glance","SP_ID, username, email or name":"SP_Shaida, username, imel ko suna","ST":"ST","START CREATOR CHALLENGE":"Fara Mahalicci CHALLENGE","SUBMIT CHALLENGE":"SUBMIT ƙalubale","Safety":"Tsaro","Safety & Privacy":"Tsaro & Sirri","Safety Center":"Tsaro Center","Safety Help":"Tsaro Taimako","Safety and fairness":"Tsaro da fairness","Safety before ranking":"Tsaro kafin matsayi","Safety tools":"Tsaro tools","Save":"Ajiye","Save Feed Controls":"Ajiye Ciyarwa Controls","Save Memory":"Ajiye Memory","Save New Password":"Ajiye Sabo Kalmar sirri","Save a prediction":"Ajiye wani prediction","Save changes":"Ajiye canje-