…":"Bincika abokai…","Search help":"Bincika taimako","Search help topics":"Bincika taimako topics","Search loaded Room messages for words or phrases.":"Bincika loaded Ɗaki saƙonni don words ko phrases.","Search notifications":"Bincika sanarwa","Search posts or #hashtags…":"Bincika wallafe-wallafe ko #hashtags…","Search posts, Rooms, calls, QR, notifications…":"Bincika wallafe-wallafe, Ɗakuna, calls, QR, sanarwa…","Search rooms or tags":"Bincika ɗakuna ko tags","Search rooms or tags...":"Bincika ɗakuna ko tags...","Search the guide":"Bincika na jagora","Search the guide — e.g. Rooms, privacy, stories, XP, calls…":"Bincika na jagora — e.g. Ɗakuna, sirri, labarai, XP, calls…","Search this guide for a feature, action, or problem.":"Bincika wannan jagora don wani feature, aiki, ko problem.","Season Points":"Season Points","Season Points vs XP":"Season Points vs XP","Season pts":"Season pts","Season sources are controlled and reward caps limit repetitive farming. Manipulating the browser cannot directly award points.":"Season sources su controlled da reward caps limit repetitive farming. Manipulating na burauza cannot directly award points.","Seasons turn World activity into a shared score. Your points are awarded by SPIKE from eligible activity — you do not manually claim points.":"Seasons turn Duniya aiki into wani shared score. Naka points su awarded by SPIKE daga cancanta aiki — kai do not manually claim points.","Sections":"Sections","Secure":"Amintacce","Secure account recovery":"Amintacce asusun farfadowa","Secure entry":"Amintacce entry","Security abuse":"Security abuse","See Room members, online state and available public identity information.":"See Ɗaki mambobi, kan layi state da akwai na jama’a ainihi bayani.","See active community contributors.":"See aiki al’umma contributors.","See communities you own/manage once eligible.":"See al’ummomi kai own/sarrafa once cancanta.","See what is happening, discover content, react, comment and publish.":"See menene ne happening, gano abun ciki, react, comment da publish.","See what people are doing with your Signals — who liked, commented, shared, saved or viewed them.":"See menene mutane su doing da naka Signals — waye liked, commented, shared, ajiye ko viewed them.","See what''s happening and share your own updates.":"See menene''s happening da raba naka own updates.","Select a Room to inspect everyone registered in that Room.":"Zaɓi wani Ɗaki zuwa inspect kowa registered a cewa Ɗaki.","Select a channel to load messages.":"Zaɓi wani channel zuwa load saƙonni.","Select a friend to start a private conversation. Send text, photos, videos, files and voice notes in one place.":"Zaɓi wani aboki zuwa fara wani na sirri tattaunawa. Aika text, photos, videos, files da murya notes a one place.","Select a person or conversation.":"Zaɓi wani person ko tattaunawa.","Select one fixed XP difficulty tier.":"Zaɓi one fixed XP difficulty tier.","Selected Signal media":"Selected Sigina kafofin watsa labarai","Selected media":"Selected kafofin watsa labarai","Self-harm encouragement":"Self-harm encouragement","Send":"Aika","Send Collaboration Invite":"Aika Collaboration Invite","Send Reset Link":"Aika Sake saita Mahada","Send a controlled announcement, notification, private message, or both to registered SPIKE users.":"Aika wani controlled announcement, notification, na sirri saƙo, ko duka zuwa registered SPIKE masu amfani.","Send a friend request":"Aika wani aboki request","Send available gifts to Room members using Coins. Recipients can receive Gems according to the Room''s live economy.":"Aika akwai gifts zuwa Ɗaki mambobi using Coins. Recipients iya receive Gems according zuwa na ɗaki''s live economy.","Send it.":"Aika it.","Send media & voice notes":"Aika kafofin watsa labarai & murya notes","Send text, photos, videos, files and voice notes.":"Aika text, photos, videos, files da murya notes.","Senior school exams":"Senior makaranta exams","Sensitive admin actions.":"Sensitive mai gudanarwa ayyuka.","Series":"Series","Series description":"Series bayani","Series title":"Series take","Serious fuel":"Serious fuel","Set a device-local pulse such as Building, Learning, Working or Exploring.":"Set wani device-local pulse such as Building, Learning, Working ko Exploring.","Set up your profile":"Set sama naka bayanan martaba","Settings":"Saituna","Setup:":"Setup:","Severity":"Severity","Sexual content":"Sexual abun ciki","Sexual exploitation":"Sexual exploitation","Sexual exploitation, non-consensual sexual imagery and sexual content involving minors are prohibited. Some adult sexual content may also be restricted under product-specific rules.":"Sexual exploitation, non-consensual sexual imagery da sexual abun ciki involving minors su haramun. Some adult sexual abun ciki na iya also be restricted under product-specific dokoki.","Share":"Raba","Share carefully":"Raba carefully","Share profile":"Raba bayanan martaba","Share with your SPIKE QR":"Raba da naka SPIKE QR","Share your profile":"Raba naka bayanan martaba","Share your profile through the device share sheet or copy a profile link.":"Raba naka bayanan martaba ta hanyar na device raba sheet ko kwafi wani bayanan martaba mahada.","Shares":"Shares","Sharing":"Sharing","Shop":"Shop","Short bio":"Short bio","Shorten":"Shorten","Show":"Nuna","Show online status":"Nuna kan layi hali","Show password":"Nuna kalmar sirri","Show political content":"Nuna political abun ciki","Show sensitive content":"Nuna sensitive abun ciki","Show smart streak tip":"Nuna smart jerin nasara tip","Show spoilers":"Nuna spoilers","Show this code to someone nearby. They can scan it and connect with you without a friend request.":"Nuna wannan lamba zuwa someone nearby. They iya scan it da haɗa da kai without wani aboki request.","Sign In":"Shiga","Sign in":"Sa hannu a","Sign in again":"Sa hannu a again","Sign in before joining or creating rooms":"Sa hannu a kafin joining ko creating ɗakuna","Sign in or create an account":"Sa hannu a ko ƙirƙira 