gani ko presentation options ina offered, but they do not guarantee wani leaderboard position ko replace genuine participation.","Some features depend on your account, connection, Room membership, device or browser capabilities. Make sure your browser is up to date and complete any steps shown in the app.":"Some features depend akan naka asusun, haɗi, Ɗaki membership, device ko burauza capabilities. Make sure naka burauza ne sama zuwa date da complete any steps shown a na app.","Something feels unsafe.":"Something feels unsafe.","Source of truth":"Source na truth","Spam":"Spam","Spam and manipulation":"Spam da manipulation","Spike@gmail10p.com":"Spike@gmail10p.com","Start":"Fara","Start Chain":"Fara Chain","Start a SPIKE":"Fara wani SPIKE","Start a video call":"Fara wani video kira","Start an audio call":"Fara wani audio kira","Start an idea and let people build on it one response at a time.":"Fara wani idea da let mutane build akan it one response at wani lokaci.","Start as Novice":"Fara as Novice","Start chatting":"Fara chatting","Start collaboration":"Fara collaboration","Start exploring":"Fara exploring","Start here":"Fara here","Start message":"Fara saƙo","Start the first entry…":"Fara na first entry…","Started at age 15 while in school, determined to become a web developer and create something the world would acknowledge.":"Started at age 15 while a makaranta, determined zuwa become wani web developer da ƙirƙira something na duniya would acknowledge.","Status":"Hali","Status: Checking…":"Hali: Checking…","Stay in control of your SPIKE experience.":"Stay a control na naka SPIKE experience.","Step 2 of 2":"Step 2 na 2","Stop engaging, use block/report tools where appropriate, and protect your private information. Do not retaliate or publish someone else''s private details.":"Stop engaging, yi amfani toshe/ba da rahoto tools ina appropriate, da protect naka na sirri bayani. Do not retaliate ko publish someone else''s na sirri details.","Stop normal app access during deployments or incidents. The setting is server-controlled.":"Stop al’ada app samun dama during deployments ko incidents. Na setting ne uwar garke-controlled.","Stories":"Labarai","Stories expire after 24 hours. Add text, a photo/video, and optional audio directly from your device.":"Labarai expire after 24 hours. Add text, wani photo/video, da zaɓi ne audio directly daga naka device.","Stories expire after 24 hours. You can create a Story from a photo/video and optional audio. Story actions can include sharing, sharing a Story, scheduling Story sharing, and deleting your own Story.":"Labarai expire after 24 hours. Kai iya ƙirƙira wani Labari daga wani photo/video da zaɓi ne audio. Labari ayyuka iya include sharing, sharing wani Labari, scheduling Labari sharing, da deleting naka own Labari.","Story":"Labari","Story smart actions":"Labari smart ayyuka","Story text…":"Labari text…","Story viewer":"Labari viewer","Streak multipliers JSON":"Jerin nasara multipliers JSON","Streak rewards JSON":"Jerin nasara rewards JSON","Stronger model signal. Still not guaranteed.":"Stronger model sigina. Still not guaranteed.","Student profile":"Student bayanan martaba","Study what performs well, then make your own original version instead of copying people.":"Study menene performs well, then make naka own original version instead na copying mutane.","Style 1":"Style 1","Subjects":"Subjects","Submit an appeal":"Submit wani ƙara","Submit appeal":"Submit ƙara","Submit report":"Submit ba da rahoto","Suggestions":"Suggestions","Suggestions are generated locally from your draft.":"Suggestions su generated locally daga naka draft.","Super Admin":"Super Mai gudanarwa","Support Admin":"Support Mai gudanarwa","Support SPIKE":"Support SPIKE","Support checkout":"Support checkout","Support continued polish, reliability, accessibility and new community features.":"Support continued polish, reliability, accessibility da sabo al’umma features.","Sustained targeted abuse, threats, humiliation campaigns and coordinated harassment are prohibited. Ordinary disagreement or criticism is not automatically harassment.":"Sustained targeted abuse, threats, humiliation campaigns da coordinated harassment su haramun. Ordinary disagreement ko criticism ne not automatically harassment.","Switch between Room conversation channels.":"Switch between Ɗaki tattaunawa channels.","Switch style":"Switch style","Switch theme":"Switch jigo","System":"Tsari","THE MEMBER PLAYBOOK":"Na Mamba PLAYBOOK","THE SOCIAL LAYER BEYOND THE FEED":"Na SOCIAL LAYER BEYOND Na Ciyarwa","THE SPIKE IDEA":"Na SPIKE IDEA","TODAY''S FOCUS":"yau''S FOCUS","TOP 50":"TOP 50","TOP PICKS":"TOP PICKS","Tags":"Tags","Take a quick check":"Take wani quick duba","Take a test":"Take wani test","Talk privately with eligible connections.":"Talk privately da cancanta connections.","Tap a friend to open a private chat":"Tap wani aboki zuwa buɗe wani na sirri chat","Tap a member to view their profile, mention them, copy their username, share their profile, mute them locally, send a gift or open Top Ranking recommendations. Reporting is available when appropriate.":"Tap wani mamba zuwa duba their bayanan martaba, mention them, kwafi their username, raba their bayanan martaba, mute them locally, aika wani gift ko buɗe Top Matsayi recommendations. Reporting ne akwai lokacin appropriate.","Tap sides to navigate · Hold to pause":"Tap sides zuwa navigate · Hold zuwa pause","Tap to filter":"Tap zuwa filter","Target":"Manufa","Targeted harassment":"Targeted harassment","Team to Score":"Team zuwa Score","Tell the Room community a little about you":"Tell na Ɗaki al’umma wani little game da kai","Tell us what you were trying to do, where it happened, and what you saw. Never send passwords, authentication codes, private keys or other secrets.":"Tell us menene kai were trying zuwa do, ina it happened, da menene kai saw. Never aika passwords, authentication codes, na sirri keys ko sauran secrets.","Tell us what’s wrong with this message.":"Tell us menene’s wrong da wannan saƙo.","Temporary account suspension":"Temporary asusun suspension","Temporary feature restriction":"Temporary feature restriction","Term / phrase":"Term / jimla","Terms":"Sharuɗɗa","Terrorism and extremist violence":"Terrorism da extremist violence","Test recall. Then use the result to decide what to review.":"Test recall. Then yi amfani na result zuwa decide menene zuwa bita.","Text Font Pack":"Text Font Pack","The 9-year journey":"Na 9-shekara journey","The Feed is the main discovery surface. It combines posts, stories, recommendations and creation tools.":"Na Ciyarwa ne na main ganowa surface. It combines wallafe-wallafe, labarai, recommendations da creation tools.","The Feed''s AI/search surface can answer SPIKE questions and help search posts, people and topics. The local writing assistant can polish a draft, add a hook, shorten copy or suggest hashtags without requiring an external AI API key.":"Na ciyarwa''s AI/bincika surface iya answer SPIKE questions da taimako bincika wallafe-wallafe, mutane da topics. Na local writing assistant iya polish wani draft, add wani hook, shorten kwafi ko suggest hashtags without requiring wani external AI API key.","The Friends page helps you manage connections, pending requests, online people and suggestions.":"Na Abokai shafi helps kai sarrafa connections, pending buƙatu, kan layi mutane da suggestions.","The Gamification Hub shows the current top users by XP. Rankings are competitive and can change as members earn progress.":"Na Gamification Hub shows na current top masu amfani by XP. Rankings su competitive da iya canza as mambobi earn ci gaba.","The Gamification Hub shows your authoritative progress, including XP, level, rank, streaks, daily tasks, weekly challenges, achievements, roadmap, leaderboard and XP history.":"Na Gamification Hub shows naka authoritative ci gaba, including XP, mataki, rank, streaks, kullum tasks, mako-mako challenges, achievements, roadmap, leaderboard da XP history.","The Notifications page centralizes activity alerts.":"Na Sanarwa shafi centralizes aiki alerts.","The Predictor ranks football fixtures and supported prediction markets using a model confidence signal.":"Na Predictor ranks football fixtures da ana tallafawa prediction markets using wani model amincewa sigina.","The Room may temporarily restrict posting, or your membership/role may not allow it. Check the Room information or ask a Room team member.":"Na Ɗaki na iya temporarily restrict posting, ko naka membership/matsayi na iya not allow it. Duba na Ɗaki bayani ko ask wani Ɗaki team mamba.","The app tracks your progress. One visible requirement is an account age of at least 1 year 6 months.":"Na app tracks naka ci gaba. One visible requirement ne wani asusun age na at least 1 shekara 6 months.","The beginning":"Na beginning","The canonical workflow is pending → under review → approved or rejected. The system should prevent duplicate active appeals for the same moderation case.":"Na canonical workflow ne pending → under bita → approved ko rejected. Na tsari should prevent duplicate aiki appeals don na same tsari ƙara.","The current challenge uses community-safety scenarios. The visible pass threshold is 80%.":"Na current challenge uses al’umma-tsaro scenarios. Na visible pass threshold ne 80%.","The link will open the dedicated password-reset page where you can choose and save a new password.":"Na mahada will buɗe na dedicated kalmar sirri-sake saita shafi ina kai iya zaɓa da ajiye wani sabo kalmar sirri.","The page says I am offline or content will not load.":"Na shafi says I am offline ko abun ciki will not load.","The person and story behind SPIKE.":"Na person da labari behind SPIKE.","The removal or restriction notice should identify whether an appeal is available. An appeal should reference the original moderation case rather than creating an unrelated case.":"Na removal ko restriction notice should identify whether wani ƙara ne akwai. Wani ƙara should reference na original tsari ƙara rather than creating wani unrelated ƙara.","The reset link opens a dedicated secure page where you can create and save your new password.":"Na sake saita mahada opens wani dedicated amintacce shafi ina kai iya ƙirƙira da ajiye naka sabo kalmar sirri.","The strongest SPIKE account is not the loudest one. It is the one that people trust, enjoy, learn from and want to return to.":"Na strongest SPIKE asusun ne not na loudest one. It ne na one cewa mutane trust, enjoy, learn daga da so zuwa return zuwa.","Theme":"Jigo","These additions use the existing Feed, composer, creator, notifications, profile and navigation systems. They do not replace your current buttons or routes.":"These additions yi amfani na existing Ciyarwa, composer, mahalicci, sanarwa, bayanan martaba da navigation systems. They do not replace naka current buttons ko routes.","These are milestones, never manually claimed by members.":"These su milestones, never manually claimed by mambobi.","Think About Me":"Think Game da Ni","Think of SPIKE as a set of connected spaces. Use the destination that matches what you want to accomplish.":"Think na SPIKE as wani set na connected spaces. Yi amfani na destination cewa matches menene kai so zuwa accomplish.","This Intelligence Suite is the foundation for a future personalized SPIKE home: people, conversations, communities, learning, predictions, events and creator activity in one place.":"Wannan Intelligence Suite ne na foundation don wani future personalized SPIKE gida: mutane, tattaunawa, al’ummomi, learning, predictions, events da mahalicci aiki a one place.","This guide is focused on using SPIKE and does not expose internal implementation details or secrets.":"Wannan jagora ne focused akan using SPIKE da does not expose internal implementation details ko secrets.","This image could not be displayed.":"Wannan image could not be displayed.","This is the policy source of truth for SPIKE safety, content moderation, enforcement, recommendations and appeals. Product systems should reference policy IDs and policy versions rather than duplicating rules.":"Wannan ne na manufa source na truth don SPIKE tsaro, abun ciki tsari, enforcement, recommendations da appeals. Product systems should reference manufa IDs da manufa versions rather than duplicating dokoki.","This message will be permanently removed for everyone in this Room. This action cannot be undone.":"Wannan saƙo will be permanently removed don kowa a wannan Ɗaki. Wannan aiki cannot be undone.","This page is built around the confirmed SPIKE room contract: rooms + room_members. Visibility here is client-side only; Supabase RLS remains the final authorization boundary.":"Wannan shafi ne built around na confirmed SPIKE ɗaki contract: ɗakuna + ɗaki_mambobi. Gani here ne client-side kawai; Supabase RLS remains na final authorization boundary.","This page is designed as the premium support front-end. Connect it to your verified payment provider/server endpoint before accepting real payments.":"Wannan shafi ne designed as na premium support front-end. Haɗa it zuwa naka verified payment provider/uwar garke endpoint kafin accepting real payments.","This room may have been deleted, you may not have access, or the room ID is invalid.":"Wannan ɗaki na iya have been deleted, kai na iya not have samun dama, ko na ɗaki Shaida ne invalid.","Threats of serious physical harm, targeted incitement of violence and credible plans to harm people are prohibited. Immediate-risk cases may receive priority escalation.":"Threats na serious physical harm, targeted incitement na violence da credible plans zuwa harm mutane su haramun. Immediate-risk ƙararraki na iya receive priority escalation.","Tip:":"Tip:","Title":"Take","Today · Daily picks":"Yau · Kullum picks","Today''s fixtures":"yau''s fixtures","Today''s fixtures ranked by the SPIKE model. Use the confidence signal to compare picks; no prediction is guaranteed.":"yau''s fixtures ranked by na SPIKE model. Yi amfani na amincewa sigina zuwa compare picks; a’a prediction ne guaranteed.","Today’s streak pool":"yau’s jerin nasara pool","Top 25 by verified XP.":"Top 25 by verified XP.","Top Picks":"Top Picks","Top Signals":"Top Signals","Top-ranking formula:":"Top-matsayi formula:","Topics, comma separated":"Topics, comma separated","Total activity":"Total aiki","Track XP, levels, ranks, badges, achievements, streaks, tasks and leaderboard progress.":"Track XP, levels, ranks, badges, achievements, streaks, tasks da leaderboard ci gaba.","Trailblazer":"Trailblazer","Translate":"Fassara","Transparency":"Transparency","Treat it seriously and use the proper reporting/moderation path":"Treat it seriously da yi amfani na proper reporting/tsari path","Trending":"Trending","Trending now":"Trending yanzu","Trending rooms":"Trending ɗakuna","Troubleshooting":"Troubleshooting","Trust, responsibility and the role they need":"Trust, responsibility da na matsayi they buƙata","Try: How do I make a video call?":"Try: Yaya do I make wani video kira?","Turn a Signal into a simple vote.":"Turn wani Sigina into wani simple vote.","Type your message.":"Type naka saƙo.","U":"U","Unauthorized access, credential theft, malware distribution, exploitation of security controls and deliberate disruption of SPIKE are prohibited.":"Unauthorized samun dama, credential theft, malware distribution, exploitation na security controls da deliberate disruption na SPIKE su haramun.","Under 2.5":"Under 2.5","Understand computers, data and algorithms.":"Understand computers, data da algorithms.","Unique people":"Unique mutane","University":"University","University course explorer":"University kwas explorer","Unlock achievements":"Unlock nasarori","Unlocked automatically when the server verifies the requirement.":"Unlocked automatically lokacin na uwar garke verifies na requirement.","Unmute video":"Unmute video","Unread":"Unread","Upcoming Room events are collected into one quick view.":"Upcoming Ɗaki events su collected into one quick duba.","Update your username, profile picture, cover image and profile information from your profile.":"Update naka username, bayanan martaba picture, cover image da bayanan martaba bayani daga naka bayanan martaba.","Upheld":"Upheld","Uploading media securely.":"Uploading kafofin watsa labarai securely.","Use 8+ characters":"Yi amfani 8+ characters","Use All, Unread, Pinned, Archived, Friends and Saved views.":"Yi amfani Duk, Unread, Pinned, Archived, Abokai da Ajiye kallo.","Use Create, add text and media, optionally add a link, then publish.":"Yi amfani Ƙirƙira, add text da kafofin watsa labarai, optionally add wani mahada, then publish.","Use Daily Check-in once for the day and protect your streak when it matters to you.":"Yi amfani Kullum Duba-a once don na day da protect naka jerin nasara lokacin it matters zuwa kai.","Use Discover to move from people and posts into related topics rather than relying only on a feed.":"Yi amfani Gano zuwa move daga mutane da wallafe-wallafe into related topics rather than relying kawai akan wani ciyarwa.","Use For You, Discover, Trending, Reels, Nearby, Insights, Progress and Creator tools as available.":"Yi amfani Don Kai, Gano, Trending, Reels, Nearby, Insights, Ci gaba da Mahalicci tools as akwai.","Use Forgot password on the sign-in page and follow the recovery link. The recovery page validates the password requirements before saving.":"Yi amfani Manta kalmar sirri akan na sa hannu-a shafi da follow na farfadowa mahada. Na farfadowa shafi validates na kalmar sirri requirements kafin saving.","Use Messages and start a conversation with an eligible friend/connection. Your message permissions depend on your privacy settings and theirs.":"Yi amfani Saƙonni da fara wani tattaunawa da wani cancanta aboki/haɗi. Naka saƙo permissions depend akan naka sirri saituna da theirs.","Use Refresh, check your membership, and verify that the Room is still available. Live connections can be interrupted temporarily.":"Yi amfani Sabunta, duba naka membership, da verify cewa na Ɗaki ne still akwai. Live connections iya be interrupted temporarily.","Use Save when you want to keep a post or supported content handy for later.":"Yi amfani Ajiye lokacin kai so zuwa riƙe wani wallafa ko ana tallafawa abun ciki handy don later.","Use Settings and profile privacy controls to decide how much of your presence and profile activity you expose.":"Yi amfani Saituna da bayanan martaba sirri controls zuwa decide yaya much na naka presence da bayanan martaba aiki kai expose.","Use Stories":"Yi amfani Labarai","Use a clear name, useful bio, avatar and relevant profile details.":"Yi amfani wani raba suna, mai amfani bio, avatar da relevant bayanan martaba details.","Use an email you can access. New accounts verify through a temporary 6-digit email code.":"Yi amfani wani imel kai iya samun dama. Sabo accounts verify ta hanyar wani temporary 6-digit imel lamba.","Use an email you can access. We’ll send a 6-digit code to verify your account.":"Yi amfani wani imel kai iya samun dama. We’ll aika wani 6-digit lamba zuwa verify naka asusun.","Use appropriate moderation tools and explain the rule":"Yi amfani appropriate tsari tools da explain na rule","Use available controls to pin, mute, archive or save conversations and messages. Drafts and scheduling options can help you manage messages.":"Yi amfani akwai controls zuwa liƙa, mute, archive ko ajiye tattaunawa da saƙonni. Zayyana da scheduling options iya taimako kai sarrafa saƙonni.","Use blocking controls when you no longer want to interact with an account.":"Yi amfani blocking controls lokacin kai a’a longer so zuwa interact da wani asusun.","Use in new Signal":"Yi amfani a sabo Sigina","Use league and market filters, compare today''s fixtures and review the confidence labels. High confidence means a stronger model signal; it is not a guarantee of an outcome.":"Yi amfani league da market filters, compare yau''s fixtures da bita na amincewa labels. Babba amincewa means wani stronger model sigina; it ne not wani guarantee na wani outcome.","Use profile actions to block a member when needed. Blocking can restrict interaction.":"Yi amfani bayanan martaba ayyuka zuwa toshe wani mamba lokacin needed. Blocking iya restrict interaction.","Use profile safety controls when you need to limit or stop interactions with another account.":"Yi amfani bayanan martaba tsaro controls lokacin kai buƙata zuwa limit ko stop interactions da another asusun.","Use suggestions and the people area to discover new connections. Activity indicators may vary.":"Yi amfani suggestions da na mutane area zuwa gano sabo connections. Aiki indicators na iya vary.","Use the Room assistant when available for smart help.":"Yi amfani na Ɗaki assistant lokacin akwai don smart taimako.","Use the Room''s join option. Some Room experiences may require you to complete an account step before participating.":"Yi amfani na ɗaki''s shiga option. Some Ɗaki experiences na iya require kai zuwa complete wani asusun step kafin participating.","Use the available categories and unread filter to quickly find notifications that need your attention.":"Yi amfani na akwai categories da unread filter zuwa quickly find sanarwa cewa buƙata naka attention.","Use the available controls to mute your microphone, turn your camera on or off, and end the call.":"Yi amfani na akwai controls zuwa mute naka microphone, turn naka camera akan ko off, da end na kira.","Use the daily check-in and complete useful tasks consistently instead of bingeing activity.":"Yi amfani na kullum duba-a da complete mai amfani tasks consistently instead na bingeing aiki.","Use the email address connected to your SPIKE account.":"Yi amfani na imel address connected zuwa naka SPIKE asusun.","Use the existing Engagement/Insights area for deeper creator analytics. This suite is the control layer that connects those insights to your wider SPIKE activity.":"Yi amfani na existing Engagement/Insights area don deeper mahalicci analytics. Wannan suite ne na control layer cewa connects those insights zuwa naka wider SPIKE aiki.","Use the main navigation to move between the areas you use most. If you get stuck, check the FAQ below.":"Yi amfani na main navigation zuwa move between na areas kai yi amfani most. If kai get stuck, duba na FAQ below.","Use the name you want displayed on your SPIKE profile.":"Yi amfani na suna kai so displayed akan naka SPIKE bayanan martaba.","Use the password recovery option on the sign-in screen and follow the instructions.":"Yi amfani na kalmar sirri farfadowa option akan na sa hannu-a screen da follow na instructions.","Use the profile sharing option to copy or share your profile with someone else.":"Yi amfani na bayanan martaba sharing option zuwa kwafi ko raba naka bayanan martaba da someone else.","Use the same SPIKE theme preference across pages.":"Yi amfani na same SPIKE jigo preference across pages.","Use the ☆ Save control on a prediction to keep it in your Saved view for quick access later.":"Yi amfani na ☆ Ajiye control akan wani prediction zuwa riƙe it a naka Ajiye duba don quick samun dama later.","Use “Forgot password?” to receive a recovery link. The dedicated recovery page lets you choose a new password.":"Yi amfani “Manta kalmar sirri?” zuwa receive wani farfadowa mahada. Na dedicated farfadowa shafi lets kai zaɓa wani sabo kalmar sirri.","Useful contributions are the goal. Do not spam empty entries or create endless activity only for progression.":"Mai amfani contributions su na goal. Do not spam empty entries ko ƙirƙira endless aiki kawai don progression.","User":"Mai amfani","User email":"Mai amfani imel","User notices":"Mai amfani notices","User requests":"Mai amfani buƙatu","Username":"Username","Users":"Masu amfani","Users are expected to participate without abusing people or the platform.":"Masu amfani su expected zuwa shiga without abusing mutane ko na platform.","Users are responsible for having appropriate rights to content they upload or share.":"Masu amfani su responsible don having appropriate rights zuwa abun ciki they upload ko raba.","Users must not expose another person''s sensitive personal information without an appropriate lawful and legitimate basis. Admin access to private moderation data must be permission-controlled and audited.":"Masu amfani must not expose another person''s sensitive personal bayani without wani appropriate lawful da legitimate basis. Mai gudanarwa samun dama zuwa na sirri tsari data must be permission-controlled da audited.","Users should not upload material they do not have permission or a lawful basis to use. SPIKE should provide an appropriate copyright complaint and takedown process.":"Masu amfani should not upload material they do not have permission ko wani lawful basis zuwa yi amfani. SPIKE should provide wani appropriate copyright complaint da takedown process.","VERIFYING":"VERIFYING","Velvet Nocturne":"Velvet Nocturne","Verification code":"Verification lamba","Verification progress":"Verification ci gaba","Verification status":"Verification hali","Verified":"Verified","Verified metric":"Verified metric","Verify code":"Verify lamba","Versioning":"Versioning","Video call":"Video kira","View a case and submit an appeal":"Duba wani ƙara da submit wani ƙara","View and participate in community events where available.":"Duba da shiga a al’umma events ina akwai.","View library →":"Duba library →","View profile":"Duba bayanan martaba","Views":"Kallo","Violence":"Violence","Violence and credible threats":"Violence da credible threats","Voice call":"Murya kira","Voice note":"Murya note","Voice notes":"Murya notes","Voice/video calls":"Murya/video calls","Vote in active polls. Where permitted, Room staff can create and manage them.":"Vote a aiki ƙuri’u. Ina permitted, Ɗaki staff iya ƙirƙira da sarrafa them.","Voting and winning":"Voting da winning","WAEC":"WAEC","WORLD":"Duniya","Wait briefly, then retry. If it still times out, check your connection and sign in again. A profile-loading problem should not prevent the rest of the app from being usable.":"Wait briefly, then sake gwadawa. If it still times out, duba naka haɗi da sa hannu a again. Wani bayanan martaba-ana lodawa problem should not prevent na rest na na app daga being usable.","Wallet balances are backend-controlled.":"Wallet balances su backend-controlled.","Warn":"Gargaɗi","Warning or educational notice":"Warning ko educational notice","We sent a 6-digit verification code to":"We sent wani 6-digit verification lamba zuwa","We will be back shortly.":"We will be baya shortly.","Website":"Website","Weekly":"Mako-mako","Weekly Challenges":"Mako-mako Challenges","Welcome":"Barka da zuwa","Welcome back":"Barka da zuwa baya","Welcome to SPIKE":"Barka da zuwa zuwa SPIKE","Welcome to SPIKE — your place to connect with people, share updates, discover communities, chat privately, and stay in touch.":"Barka da zuwa zuwa SPIKE — naka place zuwa haɗa da mutane, raba updates, gano al’ummomi, chat privately, da stay a touch.","Welcome to SPIKE! 🎉":"Barka da zuwa zuwa SPIKE! 🎉","What are you battling over?":"Menene su kai battling over?","What brings this Circle together?":"Menene brings wannan Circle together?","What do you want people to hear?":"Menene do kai so mutane zuwa hear?","What do you want to remember?":"Menene do kai so zuwa remember?","What is a Battle?":"Menene ne wani Battle?","What is a Circle?":"Menene ne wani Circle?","What is a Community Mission?":"Menene ne wani Al’umma Mission?","What is a Season?":"Menene ne wani Season?","What is a Signal Chain?":"Menene ne wani Sigina Chain?","What is included?":"Menene ne included?","What is this room about?":"Menene ne wannan ɗaki game da?","What should I do today?":"Menene should I do yau?","What should I include when contacting support?":"Menene should I include lokacin contacting support?","What should people build together?":"Menene should mutane build together?","What should the community accomplish?":"Menene should na al’umma accomplish?","What should this Feed focus on?":"Menene should wannan Ciyarwa focus akan?","What to do when SPIKE is slow, signed out, or waiting for data.":"Menene zuwa do lokacin SPIKE ne slow, signed out, ko waiting don data.","What your support means":"Menene naka support means","WhatsApp":"WhatsApp","When content is removed or restricted, the user notification should provide a clear reason and identify the applicable policy category when safe and appropriate to disclose.":"Lokacin abun ciki ne removed ko restricted, na mai amfani notification should provide wani raba reason da identify na applicable manufa category lokacin safe da appropriate zuwa disclose.","When the mission reaches its server-defined target, the eligible completion reward is awarded once. You cannot manually grant yourself XP or change the reward from the browser.":"Lokacin na mission reaches its uwar garke-defined manufa, na cancanta completion reward ne awarded once. Kai cannot manually grant yourself XP ko canza na reward daga na burauza.","When translation is available, use the translation action on a message and choose the language you want.":"Lokacin translation ne akwai, yi amfani na translation aiki akan wani saƙo da zaɓa na harshe kai so.","Where available, review performance, gamification progress and creator-oriented tools.":"Ina akwai, bita performance, gamification ci gaba da mahalicci-oriented tools.","Where do I change privacy settings?":"Ina do I canza sirri saituna?","Where do I find my Rooms?":"Ina do I find my Ɗakuna?","Where do I go?":"Ina do I go?","Where do I see my level and badge?":"Ina do I see my mataki da badge?","Where it began":"Ina it began","Where supported, attach media or record a voice note. Your browser may ask for microphone permission when recording.":"Ina ana tallafawa, attach kafofin watsa labarai ko record wani murya note. Naka burauza na iya ask don microphone permission lokacin recording.","Who asks first":"Waye asks first","Who can call you on SPIKE":"Waye iya kira kai akan SPIKE","Who can call you through private calls.":"Waye iya kira kai ta hanyar na sirri calls.","Who can open your profile":"Waye iya buɗe naka bayanan martaba","Who can start a conversation":"Waye iya fara wani tattaunawa","Who can start private conversations with you.":"Waye iya fara na sirri tattaunawa da kai.","Who can view media on your profile.":"Waye iya duba kafofin watsa labarai akan naka bayanan martaba.","Who can view your connections":"Waye iya duba naka connections","Who can view your friends list.":"Waye iya duba naka abokai list.","Who can view your posts.":"Waye iya duba naka wallafe-wallafe.","Who can view your profile.":"Waye iya duba naka bayanan martaba.","Whole word":"Whole word","Why SPIKE?":"ni yasa SPIKE?","Why aren''t my messages updating?":"ni yasa aren''t my saƙonni updating?","Why can''t I make a call?":"ni yasa iya''t I make wani kira?","Why can''t I see a feature?":"ni yasa iya''t I see wani feature?","Why can''t I send a Room message?":"ni yasa iya''t I aika wani Ɗaki saƙo?","Why can''t I upload media?":"ni yasa iya''t I upload kafofin watsa labarai?","Why did I get signed out?":"ni yasa did I get signed out?","Why should this action be reviewed?":"ni yasa should wannan aiki be reviewed?","Why the name “SPIKE”?":"ni yasa na suna “SPIKE”?","Why this term is governed and how it should be reviewed":"ni yasa wannan term ne governed da yaya it should be reviewed","Win Either Half":"Win Either Half","Window":"Taga","World":"Duniya","Write a message":"Write wani saƙo","Write a message…":"Write wani saƙo…","Write clear rules, welcome members, moderate consistently and build useful community culture.":"Write raba dokoki, barka da zuwa mambobi, moderate consistently da build mai amfani al’umma culture.","Write the first entry.":"Write na first entry.","Write the message...":"Write na saƙo...","Write to the Circle…":"Write zuwa na Circle…","XP":"XP","XP rewards JSON":"XP rewards JSON","XP thresholds remain authoritative. Editing a level never grants XP.":"XP thresholds remain authoritative. Editing wani mataki never grants XP.","XP, levels & streaks":"XP, levels & streaks","YOUR LIFETIME SP ID":"Naka LIFETIME SP Shaida","Yes — show as app announcement":"Eh — nuna as app announcement","Yes, sign out":"Eh, sa hannu out","You become the room owner automatically.":"Kai become na ɗaki owner automatically.","You can mark notifications read, clear them, or delete read items. Settings can also control message sounds, incoming/outgoing call sounds and browser-level notifications when supported.":"Kai iya mark sanarwa read, raba them, ko goge read items. Saituna iya also control saƙo sounds, incoming/outgoing kira sounds da burauza-mataki sanarwa lokacin ana tallafawa.","You can request a new code shortly.":"Kai iya request wani sabo lamba shortly.","You can switch among Latest, Following, Popular, Trending and Saved views. Feed controls can also include time windows, following-only and sensitive-content preferences.":"Kai iya switch among Sabbi, Ana bi, Popular, Trending da Ajiye kallo. Ciyarwa controls iya also include lokaci windows, ana bi-kawai da sensitive-abun ciki preferences.","You can switch paths at any time. SPIKE progress should support your real participation, not force you into a single style.":"Kai iya switch paths at any lokaci. SPIKE ci gaba should support naka real participation, not force kai into wani single style.","You cannot vote for yourself.":"Kai cannot vote don yourself.","You do not need to use every feature. Choose the path that fits how you want to participate.":"Kai do not buƙata zuwa yi amfani every feature. Zaɓa na path cewa fits yaya kai so zuwa shiga.","You do not type an XP amount. Higher XP means a harder mission. The server accepts only SPIKE-defined tiers.":"Kai do not type wani XP amount. Higher XP means wani harder mission. Na uwar garke accepts kawai SPIKE-defined tiers.","You have already started fractions. Finish the concept, practise it once, then test yourself before moving to algebra.":"Kai have already started fractions. Finish na concept, practise it once, then test yourself kafin moving zuwa algebra.","You need a Room Account before you can join, read or send messages in a Room. Create your account from the Rooms page, then return to this Room.":"Kai buƙata wani Ɗaki Asusun kafin kai iya shiga, read ko aika saƙonni a wani Ɗaki. Ƙirƙira naka asusun daga na Ɗakuna shafi, then return zuwa wannan Ɗaki.","Your Account & Profile":"Naka Asusun & Bayanan martaba","Your Room Account":"Naka Ɗaki Asusun","Your Rooms account":"Naka Ɗakuna asusun","Your SP ID is your unique SPIKE account identification number.":"Naka SP Shaida ne naka unique SPIKE asusun identification number.","Your SPIKE password has been changed successfully. Continue to your account.":"Naka SPIKE kalmar sirri has been changed successfully. Ci gaba zuwa naka asusun.","Your SPIKE, connected.":"Naka SPIKE, connected.","Your Signal":"Naka Sigina","Your XP total maps to a level using the SPIKE level roadmap.":"Naka XP total maps zuwa wani mataki using na SPIKE mataki roadmap.","Your account is created and authenticated through SPIKE''s sign-in flow. Your lifetime SP ID is your permanent SPIKE account identifier.":"Naka asusun ne created da authenticated ta hanyar SPIKE''s sa hannu-a flow. Naka lifetime SP Shaida ne naka permanent SPIKE asusun identifier.","Your account is verified and your permanent SPIKE identity is ready.":"Naka asusun ne verified da naka permanent SPIKE ainihi ne ready.","Your appeals":"Naka appeals","Your choice stays yours.":"Naka choice stays yours.","Your complete SPIKE playbook.":"Naka complete SPIKE playbook.","Your connections":"Naka connections","Your controls":"Naka controls","Your conversations":"Naka tattaunawa","Your engagement":"Naka engagement","Your first few steps in SPIKE.":"Naka first few steps a SPIKE.","Your friends":"Naka abokai","Your full name":"Naka full suna","Your goal changes the study path we recommend.":"Naka goal canje-canje na study path we recommend.","Your identity, level and reputation inside SPIKE Rooms.":"Naka ainihi, mataki da reputation inside SPIKE Ɗakuna.","Your invitations":"Naka invitations","Your network":"Naka network","Your password":"Naka kalmar sirri","Your personalized feed. Ranking can respond to your interests and interactions.":"Naka personalized ciyarwa. Matsayi iya respond zuwa naka interests da interactions.","Your policy cases":"Naka manufa ƙararraki","Your profile":"Naka bayanan martaba","Your profile can display a SPIKE QR code. A nearby person can scan it and connect instantly when the feature is available.":"Naka bayanan martaba iya display wani SPIKE QR lamba. Wani nearby person iya scan it da haɗa instantly lokacin na feature ne akwai.","Your progress":"Naka ci gaba","Your recovery link is active. Choose a new password below and save it to your SPIKE account.":"Naka farfadowa mahada ne aiki. Zaɓa wani sabo kalmar sirri below da ajiye it zuwa naka SPIKE asusun.","Your selected XP tier determines the mission difficulty, target and time window. These values are enforced by SPIKE.":"Naka selected XP tier determines na mission difficulty, manufa da lokaci taga. These values su enforced by SPIKE.","Your session may have expired or become invalid. Sign in again. If it keeps happening, check your internet connection and browser settings.":"Naka session na iya have expired ko become invalid. Sa hannu a again. If it keeps happening, duba naka internet haɗi da burauza saituna.","Your session will be signed out on this device. You can sign back in anytime.":"Naka session will be signed out akan wannan device. Kai iya sa hannu baya a anytime.","Your streak is based on consecutive server dates, not button presses.":"Naka jerin nasara ne based akan consecutive uwar garke dates, not button presses.","Your study space":"Naka study space","Your value is measured by meaningful participation, not follower count alone.":"Naka value ne measured by meaningful participation, not follower count alone.","You’ll need access to this inbox to receive your verification code.":"kai’ll buƙata samun dama zuwa wannan inbox zuwa receive naka verification lamba.","_PREDICTOR":"_PREDICTOR","actions per person":"ayyuka per person","checking":"checking","complete profile + consistent quality + meaningful connections + Room participation + healthy streak + respectful behavior.":"complete bayanan martaba + consistent quality + meaningful connections + Ɗaki participation + healthy jerin nasara + respectful behavior.","control your seasonal ranking. They are separate systems.":"control naka seasonal matsayi. They su separate systems.","controls your normal SPIKE level.":"controls naka al’ada SPIKE mataki.","crypto, tech, general":"crypto, tech, general","days":"kwanaki","e.g. CryptoTalk":"e.g. CryptoTalk","e.g. SPIKE":"e.g. SPIKE","early progress stays approachable, while higher levels require increasingly more verified XP. Existing levels are protected from regression; future level-ups use the harder roadmap. SPIKE progression is calculated from verified server activity. Messages, Signals, Rooms, Echoes, streaks and challenges are checked before XP or achievements are awarded.":"early ci gaba stays approachable, while higher levels require increasingly ƙari verified XP. Existing levels su protected daga regression; future mataki-ups yi amfani na harder roadmap. SPIKE progression ne calculated daga verified uwar garke aiki. Saƙonni, Signals, Ɗakuna, Echoes, streaks da challenges su checked kafin XP ko achievements su awarded.","football predictions.":"football predictions.","give it a title, optional description, then write the first link.":"give it wani take, zaɓi ne bayani, then write na first mahada.","https://example.com":"https://example.com","if you would not do the action without the XP reward, reconsider whether it is valuable participation.":"if kai would not do na aiki without na XP reward, reconsider whe